 করেছেন","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87820,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّبَوٰا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"l-riba","translation_bn":"সুদকে","root":"ربو","lemma":"رِّبَوٰا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87822,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87823,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُۥ","transliteration":"jāahu","translation_bn":"তার কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87824,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مَوْعِظَةٌۭ","transliteration":"mawʿiẓatun","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"وعظ","lemma":"مَّوْعِظَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87825,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87826,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّهِۦ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87827,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنتَهَىٰ","transliteration":"fa-intahā","translation_bn":"সে অতঃপর বিরত হয়েছে (সুদখোরী হতে)","root":"نهي","lemma":"ٱنتَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87828,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"তবে তার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":87829,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":87830,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"سَلَفَ","transliteration":"salafa","translation_bn":"অতীত হয়ছে (হয়ে গেছে)","root":"سلف","lemma":"سَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87831,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْرُهُۥٓ","transliteration":"wa-amruhu","translation_bn":"এবং তার ব্যাপার (সোপর্দ)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":87832,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87833,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":87835,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"আর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87836,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"عَادَ","transliteration":"ʿāda","translation_bn":"পুনরাবৃত্তি করবে","root":"عود","lemma":"عَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87837,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"তাহলে ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":87838,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী (হবে)","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87839,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87841,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":87842,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87843,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"চিরস্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87844,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"٢٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna yakulūna l-riba lā yaqūmūna illā kamā yaqūmu alladhī yatakhabbaṭuhu l-shayṭānu mina l-masi dhālika bi-annahum qālū innamā l-bayʿu mith''lu l-riba wa-aḥalla l-lahu l-bayʿa waḥarrama l-riba faman jāahu mawʿiẓatun min rabbihi fa-intahā falahu mā salafa wa-amruhu ilā l-lahi waman ʿāda fa-ulāika aṣḥābu l-nāri hum fīhā khālidūna', 'যারা সূদ খায়, তারা সেই লোকের মত দাঁড়াবে যাকে শয়ত্বান স্পর্শ দ্বারা বেহুশ করে দেয়, এ শাস্তি এজন্য যে, তারা বলে, ‘ক্রয়-বিক্রয় সূদের মতই’, অথচ কারবারকে আল্লাহ হালাল করেছেন এবং তিনি সূদকে হারাম করেছেন। সুতরাং যার নিকট তার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ হতে উপদেশবাণী পৌঁছল এবং সে বিরত হল, পূর্বে যা (সূদের আদান-প্রদান) হয়ে গেছে, তা তারই, তার বিষয় আল্লাহর জিম্মায় এবং যারা আবার আরম্ভ করবে তারাই অগ্নির বাসিন্দা, তারা তাতে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Those who consume interest cannot stand [on the Day of Resurrection] except as one stands who is being beaten by Satan into insanity. That is because they say, "Trade is [just] like interest." But Allah has permitted trade and has forbidden interest. So whoever has received an admonition from his Lord and desists may have what is past, and his affair rests with Allah. But whoever returns to [dealing in interest or usury] - those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide eternally therein.', 'যারা সূদ খায়, তারা সেই লোকের মত দাঁড়াবে যাকে শয়ত্বান স্পর্শ দ্বারা বেহুশ করে দেয়, এ শাস্তি এজন্য যে, তারা বলে, ‘ক্রয়-বিক্রয় সূদের মতই’, অথচ কারবারকে আল্লাহ হালাল করেছেন এবং তিনি সূদকে হারাম করেছেন। সুতরাং যার নিকট তার প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ হতে উপদেশবাণী পৌঁছল এবং সে বিরত হল, পূর্বে যা (সূদের আদান-প্রদান) হয়ে গেছে, তা তারই, তার বিষয় আল্লাহর জিম্মায় এবং যারা আবার আরম্ভ করবে তারাই অগ্নির বাসিন্দা, তারা তাতে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'Those who consume interest cannot stand [on the Day of Resurrection] except as one stands who is being beaten by Satan into insanity. That is because they say, "Trade is [just] like interest." But Allah has permitted trade and has forbidden interest. So whoever has received an admonition from his Lord and desists may have what is past, and his affair rests with Allah. But whoever returns to [dealing in interest or usury] - those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide eternally therein.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ٱلَّذِينَ يَأْكُلُونَ ٱلرِّبَوٰا۟ — ইকোনমিক এন্ট্রপি ও প্যারাসাইটিক এক্সপ্লয়টেশন লুপ: সুদখোরদের অবস্থা শয়তানের স্পর্শে মস্তিষ্কবিকৃত পাগলের মতো অস্থিতিশীল।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002275.mp3', now()),
  (2, 276, '', '[{"id":87845,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَمْحَقُ","transliteration":"yamḥaqu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চিহ্ন করেন","root":"محق","lemma":"يَمْحَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87846,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":87847,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّبَوٰا۟","transliteration":"l-riba","translation_bn":"সুদকে","root":"ربو","lemma":"رِّبَوٰا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87848,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيُرْبِى","transliteration":"wayur''bī","translation_bn":"ও বর্ধিত করেন","root":"ربو","lemma":"أَرْبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87849,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّدَقَـٰتِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ṣadaqāti","translation_bn":"দানকে","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87851,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87852,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":87853,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87854,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87855,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَفَّارٍ","transliteration":"kaffārin","translation_bn":"অকৃতজ্ঞ","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَّار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87856,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَثِيمٍ","transliteration":"athīmin","translation_bn":"পাপীকে","root":"اثم","lemma":"أَثِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":87857,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yamḥaqu l-lahu l-riba wayur''bī l-ṣadaqāti wal-lahu lā yuḥibbu kulla kaffārin athīmin', 'আল্লাহ সূদকে বিলুপ্ত করেন এবং খয়রাতকে বৃদ্ধি করেন, আল্লাহ অকৃতজ্ঞ পাপীদেরকে ভালবাসেন না।', 'Allah destroys interest and gives increase for charities. And Allah does not like every sinning disbeliever.', 'আল্লাহ সূদকে বিলুপ্ত করেন এবং খয়রাতকে বৃদ্ধি করেন, আল্লাহ অকৃতজ্ঞ পাপীদেরকে ভালবাসেন না।', 'Allah destroys interest and gives increase for charities. And Allah does not like every sinning disbeliever.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'يَمْحَقُ — কুরআনিক সিস্টেমিক গাইডেন্স: আয়াতটির শব্দাবলি মহাজাগতিক অপারেটিং সিস্টেমে মানুষের চেতনা, আচরণ ও সিস্টেমের শৃঙ্খলার সুনির্দিষ্ট তথ্য ও প্রজ্ঞার প্রতিফলন করে।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002276.mp3', now()),
  (2, 277, '', '[{"id":87858,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":87859,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":87860,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87861,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87862,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87863,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","translation_bn":"ও প্রতিষ্ঠা করেছে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87864,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87865,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَوُا۟","transliteration":"waātawū","translation_bn":"ও দিয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87866,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"যাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87867,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87868,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرُهُمْ","transliteration":"ajruhum","translation_bn":"তাদের পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87869,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":87870,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87871,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87872,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفٌ","transliteration":"khawfun","translation_bn":"ভয় (থাকবে)","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87873,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87874,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87875,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":87876,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزَنُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","translation_bn":"তারা দুঃখিত হবে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87877,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٢٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti wa-aqāmū l-ṣalata waātawū l-zakata lahum ajruhum ʿinda rabbihim walā khawfun ʿalayhim walā hum yaḥzanūna', 'যারা ঈমান আনে, সৎকাজ করে, নামায কায়িম করে এবং যাকাত আদায় করে, তাদের জন্য তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট সওয়াব নির্ধারিত আছে। তাদের কোন ভয় নেই, তারা চিন্তিতও না।', 'Indeed, those who believe and do righteous deeds and establish prayer and give zakah will have their reward with their Lord, and there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে, সৎকাজ করে, নামায কায়িম করে এবং যাকাত আদায় করে, তাদের জন্য তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট সওয়াব নির্ধারিত আছে। তাদের কোন ভয় নেই, তারা চিন্তিতও না।', 'Indeed, those who believe and do righteous deeds and establish prayer and give zakah will have their reward with their Lord, and there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'إِنَّ — কুরআনিক সিস্টেমিক গাইডেন্স: আয়াতটির শব্দাবলি মহাজাগতিক অপারেটিং সিস্টেমে মানুষের চেতনা, আচরণ ও সিস্টেমের শৃঙ্খলার সুনির্দিষ্ট তথ্য ও প্রজ্ঞার প্রতিফলন করে।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002277.mp3', now()),
  (2, 278, '', '[{"id":87878,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":87879,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":87880,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87881,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87882,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":87883,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَذَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wadharū","translation_bn":"এবং ছেড়ে দাও","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87884,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":87885,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَقِىَ","transliteration":"baqiya","translation_bn":"বকেয়া আছে","root":"بقي","lemma":"بَقِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87886,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87887,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّبَوٰٓا۟","transliteration":"l-riba","translation_bn":"সুদ","root":"ربو","lemma":"رِّبَوٰا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87888,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":87889,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87890,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87891,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ittaqū l-laha wadharū mā baqiya mina l-riba in kuntum mu''minīna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর এবং বাকী সূদ ছেড়ে দাও, যদি তোমরা ঈমানদার হও।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and give up what remains [due to you] of interest, if you should be believers.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর এবং বাকী সূদ ছেড়ে দাও, যদি তোমরা ঈমানদার হও।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and give up what remains [due to you] of interest, if you should be believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا — কুরআনিক সিস্টেমিক গাইডেন্স: আয়াতটির শব্দাবলি মহাজাগতিক অপারেটিং সিস্টেমে মানুষের চেতনা, আচরণ ও সিস্টেমের শৃঙ্খলার সুনির্দিষ্ট তথ্য ও প্রজ্ঞার প্রতিফলন করে।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002278.mp3', now()),
  (2, 279, '', '[{"id":87892,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87893,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":87894,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَفْعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"tafʿalū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কর","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87895,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَأْذَنُوا۟","transliteration":"fadhanū","translation_bn":"তোমরা তবে ঘোষণা শুনে রাখো","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":87896,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِحَرْبٍۢ","transliteration":"biḥarbin","translation_bn":"যুদ্ধের (বিষয়ে)","root":"حرب","lemma":"حَرْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87897,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87898,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":87899,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87901,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87902,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تُبْتُمْ","transliteration":"tub''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা তওবা কর","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87903,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"falakum","translation_bn":"তবে (থাকবে) তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":87904,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رُءُوسُ","transliteration":"ruūsu","translation_bn":"মূলধন","root":"راس","lemma":"رَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87905,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلِكُمْ","transliteration":"amwālikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সম্পদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87906,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":87907,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَظْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"taẓlimūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অবিচার করো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87908,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87909,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"tuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হবে (তোমাদের উপর)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87910,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٢٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in lam tafʿalū fadhanū biḥarbin mina l-lahi warasūlihi wa-in tub''tum falakum ruūsu amwālikum lā taẓlimūna walā tuẓ''lamūna', 'অতঃপর যদি না ছাড় তবে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের নিকট হতে যুদ্ধের ঘোষণা শুনে লও। কিন্তু যদি তোমরা তাওবাহ কর, তবে তোমরা তোমাদের মূলধন পাবে, এতে তোমাদের দ্বারা অত্যাচার হবে না, আর তোমরাও অত্যাচারিত হবে না।', 'And if you do not, then be informed of a war [against you] from Allah and His Messenger. But if you repent, you may have your principal - [thus] you do no wrong, nor are you wronged.', 'অতঃপর যদি না ছাড় তবে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের নিকট হতে যুদ্ধের ঘোষণা শুনে লও। কিন্তু যদি তোমরা তাওবাহ কর, তবে তোমরা তোমাদের মূলধন পাবে, এতে তোমাদের দ্বারা অত্যাচার হবে না, আর তোমরাও অত্যাচারিত হবে না।', 'And if you do not, then be informed of a war [against you] from Allah and His Messenger. But if you repent, you may have your principal - [thus] you do no wrong, nor are you wronged.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'فَإِن — কুরআনিক সিস্টেমিক গাইডেন্স: আয়াতটির শব্দাবলি মহাজাগতিক অপারেটিং সিস্টেমে মানুষের চেতনা, আচরণ ও সিস্টেমের শৃঙ্খলার সুনির্দিষ্ট তথ্য ও প্রজ্ঞার প্রতিফলন করে।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002279.mp3', now()),
  (2, 280, '', '[{"id":87911,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87912,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয় (খাতক)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87913,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"(একটি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87914,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عُسْرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿus''ratin","translation_bn":"অভাবগ্রস্ত","root":"عسر","lemma":"عُسْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87915,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَنَظِرَةٌ","transliteration":"fanaẓiratun","translation_bn":"অবসর তবে দেবে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَظِرَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87916,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87917,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَيْسَرَةٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"maysaratin","translation_bn":"সচ্ছলতা","root":"يسر","lemma":"مَيْسَرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87919,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَن","transliteration":"wa-an","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":87920,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَصَدَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"taṣaddaqū","translation_bn":"তোমদের সদকা করে দেওয়া","root":"صدق","lemma":"تَصَدَّقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87921,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87922,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87924,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":87925,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87926,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানতে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87927,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٢٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in kāna dhū ʿus''ratin fanaẓiratun ilā maysaratin wa-an taṣaddaqū khayrun lakum in kuntum taʿlamūna', 'যদি সে (ঋণ গ্রহণকারী) দরিদ্র হয়, তবে স্বচ্ছল অবস্থা আসা পর্যন্ত অবকাশ দিবে আর মাফ করে দেয়া তোমাদের পক্ষে অতি উত্তম, যদি তোমরা জানতে!', 'And if someone is in hardship, then [let there be] postponement until [a time of] ease. But if you give [from your right as] charity, then it is better for you, if you only knew.', 'যদি সে (ঋণ গ্রহণকারী) দরিদ্র হয়, তবে স্বচ্ছল অবস্থা আসা পর্যন্ত অবকাশ দিবে আর মাফ করে দেয়া তোমাদের পক্ষে অতি উত্তম, যদি তোমরা জানতে!', 'And if someone is in hardship, then [let there be] postponement until [a time of] ease. But if you give [from your right as] charity, then it is better for you, if you only knew.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'وَإِن — কুরআনিক সিস্টেমিক গাইডেন্স: আয়াতটির শব্দাবলি মহাজাগতিক অপারেটিং সিস্টেমে মানুষের চেতনা, আচরণ ও সিস্টেমের শৃঙ্খলার সুনির্দিষ্ট তথ্য ও প্রজ্ঞার প্রতিফলন করে।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002280.mp3', now()),
  (2, 281, '', '[{"id":87928,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87929,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"yawman","translation_bn":"সে দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87930,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87931,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"যার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87932,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":87933,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":87935,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":87936,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُوَفَّىٰ","transliteration":"tuwaffā","translation_bn":"পূর্ণ দেয়া হবে","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87937,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87938,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":87939,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":87940,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَتْ","transliteration":"kasabat","translation_bn":"সে অর্জন করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87941,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":87942,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":87943,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":87944,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٢٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ittaqū yawman tur''jaʿūna fīhi ilā l-lahi thumma tuwaffā kullu nafsin mā kasabat wahum lā yuẓ''lamūna', 'তোমরা সেদিনের ভয় কর, যেদিন তোমাদেরকে আল্লাহর দিকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে। অতঃপর প্রত্যেক লোককে তার কৃতকর্মের বিনিময় দেয়া হবে এবং তারা কিছুমাত্র অত্যাচারিত হবে না।', 'And fear a Day when you will be returned to Allah. Then every soul will be compensated for what it earned, and they will not be treated unjustly.', 'তোমরা সেদিনের ভয় কর, যেদিন তোমাদেরকে আল্লাহর দিকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে। অতঃপর প্রত্যেক লোককে তার কৃতকর্মের বিনিময় দেয়া হবে এবং তারা কিছুমাত্র অত্যাচারিত হবে না।', 'And fear a Day when you will be returned to Allah. Then every soul will be compensated for what it earned, and they will not be treated unjustly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'وَٱتَّقُوا۟ — কুরআনিক সিস্টেমিক গাইডেন্স: আয়াতটির শব্দাবলি মহাজাগতিক অপারেটিং সিস্টেমে মানুষের চেতনা, আচরণ ও সিস্টেমের শৃঙ্খলার সুনির্দিষ্ট তথ্য ও প্রজ্ঞার প্রতিফলন করে।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/002281.mp3', now()),
