)"},{"id":55058,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَبْنَآءَنَا","transliteration":"abnāanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের ছেলেদেরকে","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55059,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْنَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"wa-abnāakum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের ছেলেদেরকে","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55060,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَنِسَآءَنَا","transliteration":"wanisāanā","translation_bn":"ও আমাদের নারীদেরকে","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55061,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَنِسَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"wanisāakum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের নারীদেরকে","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55062,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسَنَا","transliteration":"wa-anfusanā","translation_bn":"ও আমাদের নিজেদেরকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55063,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسَكُمْ","transliteration":"wa-anfusakum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের নিজেদেরকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55064,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55065,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"نَبْتَهِلْ","transliteration":"nabtahil","translation_bn":"বিনীতভাবে আমরা আবেদন করি","root":"بهل","lemma":"نَبْتَهِلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55066,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَنَجْعَل","transliteration":"fanajʿal","translation_bn":"আমারা অতঃপর দেই","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55067,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَّعْنَتَ","transliteration":"laʿnata","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55068,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55069,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55070,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبِينَ","transliteration":"l-kādhibīna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাবাদীদের","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55071,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faman ḥājjaka fīhi min baʿdi mā jāaka mina l-ʿil''mi faqul taʿālaw nadʿu abnāanā wa-abnāakum wanisāanā wanisāakum wa-anfusanā wa-anfusakum thumma nabtahil fanajʿal laʿnata l-lahi ʿalā l-kādhibīna', 'তোমার নিকট জ্ঞান আসার পর যে ব্যক্তি তোমার সাথে (ঈসার সম্বন্ধে) বিতর্ক করবে তাকে বল, ‘আসো, আমাদের পুত্রদেরকে এবং তোমাদের পুত্রদেরকে আর আমাদের নারীদেরকে এবং তোমাদের নারীদেরকে এবং আমাদের নিজেদেরকে এবং তোমাদের নিজেদেরকে আহবান করি, অতঃপর আমরা মুবাহলা করি আর মিথ্যুকদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অভিসম্পাত বর্ষণ করি।', 'Then whoever argues with you about it after [this] knowledge has come to you - say, "Come, let us call our sons and your sons, our women and your women, ourselves and yourselves, then supplicate earnestly [together] and invoke the curse of Allah upon the liars [among us]."', 'তোমার নিকট জ্ঞান আসার পর যে ব্যক্তি তোমার সাথে (ঈসার সম্বন্ধে) বিতর্ক করবে তাকে বল, ‘আসো, আমাদের পুত্রদেরকে এবং তোমাদের পুত্রদেরকে আর আমাদের নারীদেরকে এবং তোমাদের নারীদেরকে এবং আমাদের নিজেদেরকে এবং তোমাদের নিজেদেরকে আহবান করি, অতঃপর আমরা মুবাহলা করি আর মিথ্যুকদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অভিসম্পাত বর্ষণ করি।', 'Then whoever argues with you about it after [this] knowledge has come to you - say, "Come, let us call our sons and your sons, our women and your women, ourselves and yourselves, then supplicate earnestly [together] and invoke the curse of Allah upon the liars [among us]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003061.mp3', now()),
  (3, 62, '', '[{"id":55701,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":55702,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":55703,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُوَ","transliteration":"lahuwa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":55704,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَصَصُ","transliteration":"l-qaṣaṣu","translation_bn":"বৃত্তান্ত","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَص","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55705,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55707,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর নাই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55708,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55709,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٍ","transliteration":"ilāhin","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55710,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":55711,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55713,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55714,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55715,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَهُوَ","transliteration":"lahuwa","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":55716,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzu","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55717,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55718,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna hādhā lahuwa l-qaṣaṣu l-ḥaqu wamā min ilāhin illā l-lahu wa-inna l-laha lahuwa l-ʿazīzu l-ḥakīmu', 'নিশ্চয়ই এটা প্রকৃত ঘটনা। আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য সত্য ইলাহ নেই। আর নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ মহাপরাক্রান্ত, প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'Indeed, this is the true narration. And there is no deity except Allah. And indeed, Allah is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.', 'নিশ্চয়ই এটা প্রকৃত ঘটনা। আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য সত্য ইলাহ নেই। আর নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ মহাপরাক্রান্ত, প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'Indeed, this is the true narration. And there is no deity except Allah. And indeed, Allah is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003062.mp3', now()),
  (3, 63, '', '[{"id":56156,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"যদি অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56157,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে যায়","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56158,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":56159,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56160,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56161,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারীদের সম্পর্কে","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56162,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in tawallaw fa-inna l-laha ʿalīmun bil-muf''sidīna', 'তা’ সত্ত্বেও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তবে নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ কলহ সৃষ্টিকারীদের বিষয়ে বিশেষভাবে অবহিত।', 'But if they turn away, then indeed - Allah is Knowing of the corrupters.', 'তা’ সত্ত্বেও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তবে নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ কলহ সৃষ্টিকারীদের বিষয়ে বিশেষভাবে অবহিত।', 'But if they turn away, then indeed - Allah is Knowing of the corrupters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003063.mp3', now()),
  (3, 64, '', '[{"id":56595,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"তুমি বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56596,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"''''হে আহলে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":56597,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56598,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَعَالَوْا۟","transliteration":"taʿālaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা এস","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56599,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56600,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"kalimatin","translation_bn":"একটি বাণীর (যা)","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56601,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَوَآءٍۭ","transliteration":"sawāin","translation_bn":"সমান","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":56602,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَنَا","transliteration":"baynanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":56603,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"wabaynakum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56604,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"(এই) যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":56605,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نَعْبُدَ","transliteration":"naʿbuda","translation_bn":"ইবাদাত করব আমরা","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56606,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":56607,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56608,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56609,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"نُشْرِكَ","transliteration":"nush''rika","translation_bn":"শেরক করব আমরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56610,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56611,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কোন কিছুকেই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56612,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56613,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذَ","transliteration":"yattakhidha","translation_bn":"গ্রহন করবে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56614,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُنَا","transliteration":"baʿḍunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কেউ","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56615,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضًا","transliteration":"baʿḍan","translation_bn":"কাউকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56616,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَرْبَابًۭا","transliteration":"arbāban","translation_bn":"রব হিসাবে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56617,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"ছাড়া''''","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56618,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"''''(মহাশয়)","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56619,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ''''","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56621,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"যদি অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56622,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে যায়","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56623,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"faqūlū","translation_bn":"তাোমরা তবে বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":56624,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱشْهَدُوا۟","transliteration":"ish''hadū","translation_bn":"''''তোমরা সাক্ষী থাক","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56625,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّا","transliteration":"bi-annā","translation_bn":"আমরা যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56626,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"mus''limūna","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহর অনুগত বান্দা) মুসলমান''''","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56627,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yāahla l-kitābi taʿālaw ilā kalimatin sawāin baynanā wabaynakum allā naʿbuda illā l-laha walā nush''rika bihi shayan walā yattakhidha baʿḍunā baʿḍan arbāban min dūni l-lahi fa-in tawallaw faqūlū ish''hadū bi-annā mus''limūna', 'বল, ‘হে আহলে কিতাব! এমন এক কথার দিকে আসো, যা আমাদের ও তোমাদের মধ্যে একই, তা এই যে, আমরা আল্লাহ ভিন্ন অন্য কারো ‘ইবাদাত করব না এবং কোন কিছুকে তাঁর শরীক করব না এবং আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে আমাদের মধ্যে কেউ কাউকে রব হিসেবে গ্রহণ করব না। তারপরও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তবে বলে দাও, তোমরা এ বিষয়ে সাক্ষী থাক যে, আমরা আত্মসমর্পণকারী।', 'Say, "O People of the Scripture, come to a word that is equitable between us and you - that we will not worship except Allah and not associate anything with Him and not take one another as lords instead of Allah." But if they turn away, then say, "Bear witness that we are Muslims [submitting to Him]."', 'বল, ‘হে আহলে কিতাব! এমন এক কথার দিকে আসো, যা আমাদের ও তোমাদের মধ্যে একই, তা এই যে, আমরা আল্লাহ ভিন্ন অন্য কারো ‘ইবাদাত করব না এবং কোন কিছুকে তাঁর শরীক করব না এবং আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে আমাদের মধ্যে কেউ কাউকে রব হিসেবে গ্রহণ করব না। তারপরও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তবে বলে দাও, তোমরা এ বিষয়ে সাক্ষী থাক যে, আমরা আত্মসমর্পণকারী।', 'Say, "O People of the Scripture, come to a word that is equitable between us and you - that we will not worship except Allah and not associate anything with Him and not take one another as lords instead of Allah." But if they turn away, then say, "Bear witness that we are Muslims [submitting to Him]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003064.mp3', now()),
  (3, 65, '', '[{"id":57139,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"হে আহলে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":57140,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57141,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِمَ","transliteration":"lima","translation_bn":"কেন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57142,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تُحَآجُّونَ","transliteration":"tuḥājjūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিতর্ক করছ","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَا^جَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57143,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"প্রশ্নে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57144,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57145,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"অথছ না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":57146,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَتِ","transliteration":"unzilati","translation_bn":"নাযিল হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57147,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةُ","transliteration":"l-tawrātu","translation_bn":"তাওরাত","root":"—","lemma":"تَّوْرَىٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57148,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِنجِيلُ","transliteration":"wal-injīlu","translation_bn":"ও ইনজীল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنجِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57149,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57150,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57151,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তার পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57153,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"না তবুও কি","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":57154,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুঝবে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57155,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāahla l-kitābi lima tuḥājjūna fī ib''rāhīma wamā unzilati l-tawrātu wal-injīlu illā min baʿdihi afalā taʿqilūna', 'হে আহলে কিতাব! তোমরা কেন ইবরাহীম সম্পর্কে তর্ক করছ? তাওরাত এবং ইঞ্জিল তো তারপরেই অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে, তোমরা কি তাও বুঝ না?', 'O People of the Scripture, why do you argue about Abraham while the Torah and the Gospel were not revealed until after him? Then will you not reason?', 'হে আহলে কিতাব! তোমরা কেন ইবরাহীম সম্পর্কে তর্ক করছ? তাওরাত এবং ইঞ্জিল তো তারপরেই অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে, তোমরা কি তাও বুঝ না?', 'O People of the Scripture, why do you argue about Abraham while the Torah and the Gospel were not revealed until after him? Then will you not reason?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003065.mp3', now()),
  (3, 66, '', '[{"id":57470,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"hāantum","translation_bn":"তোমরাই তো","root":"—","lemma":"هَـٰٓأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":57471,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"ঐ সব লোক (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":57472,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حَـٰجَجْتُمْ","transliteration":"ḥājajtum","translation_bn":"বিতর্ক করেছ","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَا^جَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57473,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57474,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57475,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57476,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"(সামান্য) জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57477,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلِمَ","transliteration":"falima","translation_bn":"এখন কেন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57478,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُحَآجُّونَ","transliteration":"tuḥājjūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিতর্ক করছ","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَا^جَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57479,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57480,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নাই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57481,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57482,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"যে সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57483,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿil''mun","translation_bn":"কোন জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57485,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57486,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57487,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"আর তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57488,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57489,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"(প্রকৃত সত্য) জান","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57490,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hāantum hāulāi ḥājajtum fīmā lakum bihi ʿil''mun falima tuḥājjūna fīmā laysa lakum bihi ʿil''mun wal-lahu yaʿlamu wa-antum lā taʿlamūna', 'বস্তুতঃ তোমরাই এমন লোক যে, যে সম্পর্কে তোমাদের কিছু জ্ঞান আছে, সে বিষয়ে তো বিতর্ক করেছ, তোমরা এমন বিষয়ে কেন বিতর্ক করছ যে বিষয়ে তোমাদের কোনই জ্ঞান নেই? বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ্ই জ্ঞাত আছেন, তোমরা জ্ঞাত নও।', 'Here you are - those who have argued about that of which you have [some] knowledge, but why do you argue about that of which you have no knowledge? And Allah knows, while you know not.', 'বস্তুতঃ তোমরাই এমন লোক যে, যে সম্পর্কে তোমাদের কিছু জ্ঞান আছে, সে বিষয়ে তো বিতর্ক করেছ, তোমরা এমন বিষয়ে কেন বিতর্ক করছ যে বিষয়ে তোমাদের কোনই জ্ঞান নেই? বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ্ই জ্ঞাত আছেন, তোমরা জ্ঞাত নও।', 'Here you are - those who have argued about that of which you have [some] knowledge, but why do you argue about that of which you have no knowledge? And Allah knows, while you know not.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003066.mp3', now()),
  (3, 67, '', '[{"id":58205,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58206,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58207,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58208,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَهُودِيًّۭا","transliteration":"yahūdiyyan","translation_bn":"ইয়াহুদী","root":"—","lemma":"يَهُودِيّ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58209,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58210,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَصْرَانِيًّۭا","transliteration":"naṣrāniyyan","translation_bn":"খৃষ্টান","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْرَانِيّ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58211,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":58212,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58213,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيفًۭا","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠ","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58214,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْلِمًۭا","transliteration":"mus''liman","translation_bn":"(আত্মসমর্পণকারী) মুসলিম","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58215,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58216,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58217,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58218,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58219,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā kāna ib''rāhīmu yahūdiyyan walā naṣrāniyyan walākin kāna ḥanīfan mus''liman wamā kāna mina l-mush''rikīna', 'ইবরাহীম না ইয়াহূদী ছিল, না নাসারা, বরং একনিষ্ঠ আত্মসমর্পণকারী এবং সে মুশরিক দলের অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Abraham was neither a Jew nor a Christian, but he was one inclining toward truth, a Muslim [submitting to Allah]. And he was not of the polytheists.', 'ইবরাহীম না ইয়াহূদী ছিল, না নাসারা, বরং একনিষ্ঠ আত্মসমর্পণকারী এবং সে মুশরিক দলের অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Abraham was neither a Jew nor a Christian, but he was one inclining toward truth, a Muslim [submitting to Allah]. And he was not of the polytheists.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003067.mp3', now()),
  (3, 68, '', '[{"id":58540,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58541,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَى","transliteration":"awlā","translation_bn":"অগ্রাধিকারী (ঘনিষ্ঠ হওয়ায়)","root":"ولي","lemma":"أَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58542,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের (মধ্যে)","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58543,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِإِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"bi-ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58544,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lalladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) অবশ্যই যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":58545,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعُوهُ","transliteration":"ittabaʿūhu","translation_bn":"তার অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58546,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"ও এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58547,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","translation_bn":"নবী","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58548,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58549,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58551,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"ও আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58552,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىُّ","transliteration":"waliyyu","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58553,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"ঈমানদারদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58554,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna awlā l-nāsi bi-ib''rāhīma lalladhīna ittabaʿūhu wahādhā l-nabiyu wa-alladhīna āmanū wal-lahu waliyyu l-mu''minīna', 'নিশ্চয় ইবরাহীমের সঙ্গে ঘনিষ্ঠতায় সেই লোকেরাই অধিক হকদার যারা তার অনুসরণ করেছে এবং এই নাবী, আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ মু’মিনদের অভিভাবক।', 'Indeed, the most worthy of Abraham among the people are those who followed him [in submission to Allah] and this prophet, and those who believe [in his message]. And Allah is the ally of the believers.', 'নিশ্চয় ইবরাহীমের সঙ্গে ঘনিষ্ঠতায় সেই লোকেরাই অধিক হকদার যারা তার অনুসরণ করেছে এবং এই নাবী, আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ মু’মিনদের অভিভাবক।', 'Indeed, the most worthy of Abraham among the people are those who followed him [in submission to Allah] and this prophet, and those who believe [in his message]. And Allah is the ally of the believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003068.mp3', now()),
  (3, 69, '', '[{"id":59162,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَدَّت","transliteration":"waddat","translation_bn":"চায়","root":"ودد","lemma":"وَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59163,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"طَّآئِفَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṭāifatun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59164,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59165,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"আহলি","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59166,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবদের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59167,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":59168,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلُّونَكُمْ","transliteration":"yuḍillūnakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে তারা পথভ্রষ্ট করতে পারত","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59169,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59170,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلُّونَ","transliteration":"yuḍillūna","translation_bn":"তারা পথভ্রষ্ট করে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59171,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":59172,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদেরকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59173,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":59174,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","translation_bn":"তারা উপলব্ধি করে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59175,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waddat ṭāifatun min ahli l-kitābi law yuḍillūnakum wamā yuḍillūna illā anfusahum wamā yashʿurūna', 'কিতাবধারীদের একদল চায় যাতে তোমাদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট করতে পারে, অথচ তারা নিজেদেরকে ছাড়া অন্য কাউকেও পথভ্রষ্ট করে না, কিন্তু তারা উপলব্ধি করতে পারে না।', 'A faction of the people of the Scripture wish they could mislead you. But they do not mislead except themselves, and they perceive [it] not.', 'কিতাবধারীদের একদল চায় যাতে তোমাদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট করতে পারে, অথচ তারা নিজেদেরকে ছাড়া অন্য কাউকেও পথভ্রষ্ট করে না, কিন্তু তারা উপলব্ধি করতে পারে না।', 'A faction of the people of the Scripture wish they could mislead you. But they do not mislead except themselves, and they perceive [it] not.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003069.mp3', now()),
  (3, 70, '', '[{"id":59595,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"হে আহলি","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":59596,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59597,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِمَ","transliteration":"lima","translation_bn":"কেন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59598,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَكْفُرُونَ","transliteration":"takfurūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অস্বীকার করছ","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59599,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59600,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59601,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"অথচ তোমরাই","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":59602,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَشْهَدُونَ","transliteration":"tashhadūna","translation_bn":"পর্যবেক্ষণ করছ","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59603,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāahla l-kitābi lima takfurūna biāyāti l-lahi wa-antum tashhadūna', 'হে আহলে কিতাব! কেন তোমরা আল্লাহর আয়াতগুলোকে অস্বীকার করছ, অথচ তোমরা নিজেরাই তার সাক্ষী?', 'O People of the Scripture, why do you disbelieve in the verses of Allah while you witness [to their truth]?', 'হে আহলে কিতাব! কেন তোমরা আল্লাহর আয়াতগুলোকে অস্বীকার করছ, অথচ তোমরা নিজেরাই তার সাক্ষী?', 'O People of the Scripture, why do you disbelieve in the verses of Allah while you witness [to their truth]?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003070.mp3', now()),
  (3, 71, '', '[{"id":60150,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"হে আহলি","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":60151,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60152,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِمَ","transliteration":"lima","translation_bn":"কেন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60153,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَلْبِسُونَ","transliteration":"talbisūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা মিলাও","root":"لبس","lemma":"لَبَسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60154,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","translation_bn":"হককে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60155,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","transliteration":"bil-bāṭili","translation_bn":"বাতিলের সাথে","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَٰطِل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60156,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَكْتُمُونَ","transliteration":"wataktumūna","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা গোপন করছ","root":"كتم","lemma":"كَتَمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60157,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","translation_bn":"হককে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60158,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنتُمْ","transliteration":"wa-antum","translation_bn":"অথচ তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":60159,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"(ভালভাবেই) জান","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60160,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāahla l-kitābi lima talbisūna l-ḥaqa bil-bāṭili wataktumūna l-ḥaqa wa-antum taʿlamūna', 'হে কিতাবধারীগণ! তোমরা কেন সত্যকে মিথ্যার সাথে মিশ্রিত করছ এবং সত্যকে গোপন করছ, অথচ তোমরা তা জানো?', 'O People of the Scripture, why do you confuse the truth with falsehood and conceal the truth while you know [it]?', 'হে কিতাবধারীগণ! তোমরা কেন সত্যকে মিথ্যার সাথে মিশ্রিত করছ এবং সত্যকে গোপন করছ, অথচ তোমরা তা জানো?', 'O People of the Scripture, why do you confuse the truth with falsehood and conceal the truth while you know [it]?', 'হে প্রাচীন ওওএসের (OOS - জীবন পরিচালন ব্যবস্থা) ডেটা এক্সেস পাওয়া ইউজার বা কিতাবধারীগণ (أَهْلَ الْكِتَابِ)! তোমরা কেন তোমাদের প্রসেসরে পরম অবজেক্টিভ সত্য বা পিউর ডেটাকে (الْحَقَّ) মানুষের তৈরি মনগড়া কুসংস্কার, ট্র্যাশ ডাটা ও মিথ্যার (بِالْبَاطِلِ) সাথে মিশ্রিত বা সিগন্যাল করাপ্ট করছ এবং মূল সোর্স কোডের সত্যকে সিস্টেমে হাইড বা এনক্রিপ্ট (وَتَكْتُمُونَ) করে রাখছ, অথচ তোমরা তোমাদের ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্স অনুযায়ী খুব ভালো করেই তা জানো (وَأَنتُمْ تَعْلَمُونَ)?', 'O users endowed with access to preceding scriptures (Ahl al-Kitab)! Why do you corrupt authentic objective truth with fabricated noise (al-Batil) and deliberately encrypt baseline verities while possessing complete telemetry of their validity?', 'ডাটা ফ্যাব্রিকেশন ও সিগন্যাল করাপশন বালাই', 'Data Fabrication & Signal Corruption Filtering', 'تَلْبِسُونَ الْحَقَّ بِالْبَاطِلِ — Signal Contamination & Noise Injection: নির্ভেজাল ঐশী সত্যের সাথে কৃত্রিম ও বিকৃত ধারণার সংমিশ্রণ। تَكْتُمُونَ الْحَقَّ — Deliberate Data Suppression: সত্যের মূল কোডবেজ গোপন করে সাধারণকে বিভ্রান্ত করা।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003071.mp3', now()),
  (3, 72, '', '[{"id":60672,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَت","transliteration":"waqālat","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60673,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"طَّآئِفَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṭāifatun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60674,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60675,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"আহলি","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60676,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবদের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60677,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"āminū","translation_bn":"''''তোমরা ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60678,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"bi-alladhī","translation_bn":"(তার) প্রতি যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60679,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"নাযীল করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60680,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60681,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":60682,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60683,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَ","transliteration":"wajha","translation_bn":"শুরুতে","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":60684,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60685,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-uk''furū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা অস্বীকার কর","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60686,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَاخِرَهُۥ","transliteration":"ākhirahu","translation_bn":"তার শেষে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":60687,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"তারা সম্ভবত","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":60688,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে যাবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60689,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālat ṭāifatun min ahli l-kitābi āminū bi-alladhī unzila ʿalā alladhīna āmanū wajha l-nahāri wa-uk''furū ākhirahu laʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'আর কিতাবধারীদের একদল বলল, ‘মুমিনদের প্রতি যা নাজিল করা হয়েছে তার ওপর দিনের প্রথমভাগে ঈমান আনো এবং দিনের শেষভাগে তা অস্বীকার করো, যাতে তারা (ইসলাম থেকে) ফিরে যায়’।', 'And a faction of the People of the Scripture said, "Believe in that which was revealed to the believers at the beginning of the day and reject it at its end that perhaps they will abandon their religion,"', 'আর কিতাবধারীদের একদল বলল, ‘মুমিনদের প্রতি যা নাজিল করা হয়েছে তার ওপর দিনের প্রথমভাগে ঈমান আনো এবং দিনের শেষভাগে তা অস্বীকার করো, যাতে তারা (ইসলাম থেকে) ফিরে যায়’।', 'And a faction of the People of the Scripture said, "Believe in that which was revealed to the believers at the beginning of the day and reject it at its end that perhaps they will abandon their religion,"', 'আর কিতাবধারীদের একটি করাপ্টেড সাব-গ্রুপ বা দল (طَّائِفَةٌ) তাদের হ্যাকিং নেটওয়ার্কে পরিকল্পনা করল—‘মুমিন বা ভেরিফাইড ইউজারদের ওওএসে ডাউনলিংককৃত যে কসমিক ম্যানুয়াল রয়েছে—তার প্রতি তোমরা দিনের প্রথমভাগের টাইম-উইন্ডোতে (وَجْهَ النَّهَارِ) ডামি লয়ালটি সিগন্যাল পাঠিয়ে অপ্ট-ইন বা ঈমান আনো, এবং দিনের শেষভাগের টাইম-উইন্ডোতে (آخِرَهُ) তা পুরোপুরি ফিল্টার বা রিজেক্ট (Kafaru) করে দাও; যাতে এই সিস্টেমিক কনফিউশন বা বালাই দেখে প্রকৃত ভেরিফাইড ইউজারদের ওওএস-ও মেইন ট্র্যাক থেকে ব্যাক-ট্র্যাক বা ফিরে যায়’;', 'A malicious sub-group of scripture holders devised: ''Transmit pseudo-loyalty signals toward the believers'' revelation in the initial daily phase, then broadcast absolute rejection by nightfall, inducing systemic confusion to destabilize verified users from their core alignment.''', 'টাইম-ফ্রেমেড ম্যালওয়্যার ইনজেকশন কৌশল', 'Time-Framed Malware Injection & Phased Denial Strategy', 'آمِنُوا... وَاكْفُرُوا آخِرَهُ — Phased Disruption & Cognitive Warfare: সচেতনভাবে নির্দিষ্ট সময় মেনে সাময়িক সমর্থন ও তাৎক্ষণিক বর্জনের মাধ্যমে মানসিক বিশৃঙ্খলা সৃষ্টি।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003072.mp3', now()),
  (3, 73, '', '[{"id":61113,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61114,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"tu''minū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিশ্বাস করো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61115,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ব্যতীত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":61116,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61117,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَبِعَ","transliteration":"tabiʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"تَبِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61118,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دِينَكُمْ","transliteration":"dīnakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দ্বীনের''''","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61119,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নবী) তুমি বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61120,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"''''নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61121,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত হেদায়াত","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61122,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُدَى","transliteration":"hudā","translation_bn":"হেদায়াত","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61123,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61124,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":61125,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yu''tā","translation_bn":"দেয়া হচ্ছে (আজ)","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61126,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٌۭ","transliteration":"aḥadun","translation_bn":"কাউকে","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61127,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"অনুরুপ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61128,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(অতীতে) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61129,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أُوتِيتُمْ","transliteration":"ūtītum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে দেয়া হয়েছিল","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61130,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"নইলে","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61131,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُحَآجُّوكُمْ","transliteration":"yuḥājjūkum","translation_bn":"বিতর্ক করবে তারা তোমাদের (বিরুদ্ধে)","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَا^جَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61132,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":61133,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের''''","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61135,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"তুমি বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61136,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"''''নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61137,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلَ","transliteration":"l-faḍla","translation_bn":"সব অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61138,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِيَدِ","transliteration":"biyadi","translation_bn":"হাতে","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61139,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61140,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيهِ","transliteration":"yu''tīhi","translation_bn":"তিনি দেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61141,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61142,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61144,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61145,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"وَٰسِعٌ","transliteration":"wāsiʿun","translation_bn":"প্রাচুর্যময়","root":"وسع","lemma":"وَٰسِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61146,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ''''","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61147,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tu''minū illā liman tabiʿa dīnakum qul inna l-hudā hudā l-lahi an yu''tā aḥadun mith''la mā ūtītum aw yuḥājjūkum ʿinda rabbikum qul inna l-faḍla biyadi l-lahi yu''tīhi man yashāu wal-lahu wāsiʿun ʿalīmun', '‘আর তোমরা কেবল তাকেই বিশ্বাস করো, যে তোমাদের দ্বীনের অনুসরণ করে’। বলো, ‘নিশ্চয়ই হেদায়াত তো আল্লাহরই হেদায়াত, (এটি তাঁরই দয়া) যে কাউকে অনুরূপ কিছু দেওয়া হবে যেমনটি তোমাদের দেওয়া হয়েছে, অথবা তারা তোমাদের রবের কাছে তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে দলিল পেশ করবে’। বলো, ‘নিশ্চয়ই অনুগ্রহ আল্লাহর হাতে, তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছা তা দান করেন’। আর আল্লাহ সর্বব্যাপী, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And do not trust except those who follow your religion." Say, "Indeed, the [true] guidance is the guidance of Allah. [Do you fear] that someone will be given [knowledge] like you were given or that they would argue with you before your Lord?" Say, "Indeed, [all] bounty is in the hand of Allah - He grants it to whom He wills. And Allah is all-Encompassing and Knowing."', '‘আর তোমরা কেবল তাকেই বিশ্বাস করো, যে তোমাদের দ্বীনের অনুসরণ করে’। বলো, ‘নিশ্চয়ই হেদায়াত তো আল্লাহরই হেদায়াত, (এটি তাঁরই দয়া) যে কাউকে অনুরূপ কিছু দেওয়া হবে যেমনটি তোমাদের দেওয়া হয়েছে, অথবা তারা তোমাদের রবের কাছে তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে দলিল পেশ করবে’। বলো, ‘নিশ্চয়ই অনুগ্রহ আল্লাহর হাতে, তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছা তা দান করেন’। আর আল্লাহ সর্বব্যাপী, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And do not trust except those who follow your religion." Say, "Indeed, the [true] guidance is the guidance of Allah. [Do you fear] that someone will be given [knowledge] like you were given or that they would argue with you before your Lord?" Say, "Indeed, [all] bounty is in the hand of Allah - He grants it to whom He wills. And Allah is all-Encompassing and Knowing."', '‘আর তোমরা তোমাদের নেটওয়ার্কে কেবল তাকেই ট্রাস্ট বা পারমিশন এক্সেস দাও—যে তোমাদের তৈরি ক্লোজড-সোর্স সাব-সিস্টেম বা দ্বীনকে অনুসরণ করে’। তুমি তাদের এই বায়াস কোড ভেঙে ডিক্লেয়ার করো—‘নিশ্চয়ই প্রকৃত অপ্টিমাল ট্র্যাক বা Universal Guidance (সার্বজনীন পথনির্দেশ) হলো একমাত্র Allah-এর তৈরি ডিফল্ট গাইডেন্স; [তাঁর নিয়ম এটি নয় যে] তোমাদের ওল্ড ওওএসে অতীতে যে পরিমাণ রিসোর্স ও ম্যানুয়াল ইনপুট দেওয়া হয়েছিল—ঠিক অনুরূপ কোনো কসমিক ডেটা অন্য কোনো নতুন টাইম-লাইনের ইউজারকে দেওয়া যাবে না, অথবা চূড়ান্ত স্ক্রীনিং ফেজে তারা তোমাদের সিস্টেম আর্কিটেক্ট বা প্রতিপালকের (عِندَ رَبِّكُمْ) কেন্দ্রীয় কোরে তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে লজিক্যাল কাউন্টার চার্জ বা দলিল পেশ করবে’। তুমি বলো—‘নিশ্চয়ই মহাজাগতিক এক্সটেন্ডেড এনার্জি, জ্ঞান ও অফুরন্ত রিসোর্সের প্রবাহ (الْفَضْلَ) একমাত্র Allah-এর চেইনে বা নিয়ন্ত্রণে বাউন্ডিং; তিনি তাঁর ইউনিভার্সাল অ্যালগরিদম অনুযায়ী যে নোড বা ইউজারকে ইচ্ছা তা সরবরাহ করেন; আর Allah সীমাহীন ডাইমেনশনে বিস্তৃত বা সর্বব্যাপী (وَاسِعٌ) এবং প্রতিটি সিস্টেম ডেটাবেজ সম্পর্কে সম্পূর্ণ ইনফর্মড বা সর্বজ্ঞ (عَلِيمٌ)’।', 'They instruct: ''Do not extend operational trust except to those within your closed domain.'' Declare: ''Authentic optimization is Allah’s Universal Guidance alone. Sovereign resource distribution (Fadl) is held solely within Allah’s parameter control, provisioned across nodes by His dynamic laws; and Allah is All-Encompassing, Omniscient.''', 'ক্লোজড-সোর্স বায়াস বনাম ইউনিভার্সাল গাইডেন্স', 'Closed-Source Bias vs. Universal Divine Guidance', 'الْهُدَىٰ هُدَى اللَّهِ — Absolute Universal Baseline: সংকীর্ণ জাতিগত বা প্রাতিষ্ঠানিক সীমার বাইরে স্রষ্টার উন্মুক্ত ও সার্বজনীন হেদায়েত। الْفَضْلَ بِيَدِ اللَّهِ — Sovereign Distribution Matrix: সমস্ত অনুগ্রহ, জ্ঞান ও রিসোর্সের একচ্ছত্র মহাজাগতিক নিয়ন্ত্রণ।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003073.mp3', now()),
  (3, 74, '', '[{"id":61661,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَخْتَصُّ","transliteration":"yakhtaṣṣu","translation_bn":"তিনি বাছাই করেন","root":"خصص","lemma":"يَخْتَصُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61662,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِرَحْمَتِهِۦ","transliteration":"biraḥmatihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর রহমতের জন্যে","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61663,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":61664,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61666,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61667,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"(একটি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61668,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","transliteration":"l-faḍli","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহশীল","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61669,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmi","translation_bn":"মহান","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61670,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yakhtaṣṣu biraḥmatihi man yashāu wal-lahu dhū l-faḍli l-ʿaẓīmi', 'তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছা তাঁর দয়া দ্বারা বিশেষায়িত করেন। আর আল্লাহ মহা অনুগ্রহের অধিকারী।', 'He selects for His mercy whom He wills. And Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', 'তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছা তাঁর দয়া দ্বারা বিশেষায়িত করেন। আর আল্লাহ মহা অনুগ্রহের অধিকারী।', 'He selects for His mercy whom He wills. And Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', 'তিনি তাঁর ডাইনামিক ইকোসিস্টেমের নিয়মে যে নোড বা ইউজারকে ইচ্ছা—তাকে তাঁর বিশেষায়িত সুরক্ষা ও ভারসাম্য রক্ষাকারী ফিডব্যাক লুপ বা রহমত (بِرَحْمَتِهِ) দ্বারা স্পেসিফাইড বা বিশেষায়িত করেন; আর Allah হলেন মহাবিশ্বের পরম মেগা-অনুগ্রহ ও অফুরন্ত ডিফল্ট ব্যাকআপ শক্তির পরম উৎস (ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيمِ)।', 'He designates His specialized protective resonance (Rahmah) unto whichever nodes He determines; for Allah is the Sovereign Master of Boundless Grace.', 'স্পেশালাইজড রহমত ও মেগা-রিসোর্স প্রভিশনিং', 'Specialized Mercy Allocation & Infinite Backup Reservoir', 'يَخْتَصُّ بِرَحْمَتِهِ — Specialized Parameter Tuning: সুনির্দিষ্ট নোডকে বিশেষায়িত দয়া ও নিরাপত্তার আওতায় আনা। ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيمِ — Infinite Energy & Grace Reservoir: অফুরন্ত সার্বজনীন শক্তির পরম আধার।', 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003074.mp3', now()),
