reposition)"},{"id":81065,"position":71,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qulūbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের অন্তরগুলোতে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81067,"position":72,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81068,"position":73,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81069,"position":74,"text_uthmani":"بِذَاتِ","transliteration":"bidhāti","translation_bn":"অবস্থা সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81070,"position":75,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","translation_bn":"অন্তরের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81071,"position":76,"text_uthmani":"١٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma anzala ʿalaykum min baʿdi l-ghami amanatan nuʿāsan yaghshā ṭāifatan minkum waṭāifatun qad ahammathum anfusuhum yaẓunnūna bil-lahi ghayra l-ḥaqi ẓanna l-jāhiliyati yaqūlūna hal lanā mina l-amri min shayin qul inna l-amra kullahu lillahi yukh''fūna fī anfusihim mā lā yub''dūna laka yaqūlūna law kāna lanā mina l-amri shayon mā qutil''nā hāhunā qul law kuntum fī buyūtikum labaraza alladhīna kutiba ʿalayhimu l-qatlu ilā maḍājiʿihim waliyabtaliya l-lahu mā fī ṣudūrikum waliyumaḥḥiṣa mā fī qulūbikum wal-lahu ʿalīmun bidhāti l-ṣudūri', 'অতঃপর কষ্টের পর আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতি শান্তি-তন্দ্রা প্রেরণ করলেন, যা তোমাদের একদলকে আচ্ছন্ন করল এবং অন্যদল মূর্খের মতো আল্লাহর প্রতি কুধারণা পোষণ করতঃ নিজেরাই নিজেদের জীবনকে উদ্বেগাকুল করে বলল, কাজ-কর্মের ব্যাপারে (সিদ্ধান্ত গ্রহণের) আমাদের কিছুমাত্র অধিকার আছে কি? বল, ‘সমস্তই আল্লাহর নিরঙ্কুশ অধিকারভুক্ত’। তারা এমন সব কথা অন্তরে পোষণ করে- যা তোমার কাছে প্রকাশ করে না। তারা বলে, ‘যদি মতামত প্রদানের অধিকার আমাদের কিছুমাত্রও থাকত, তাহলে আমরা এ স্থলে নিহত হতাম না’। বলে দাও, ‘যদি তোমরা তোমাদের ঘরেও থাকতে, তথাপি যাদের ভাগ্যে মৃত্যু লেখা ছিল, তারা তাদের এ মৃত্যুশয্যার পানে বের হয়ে পড়ত’। এবং এজন্যও যে আল্লাহ তোমাদের অন্তরের ভেতরের বিষয়গুলো পরীক্ষা করেন এবং তোমাদের অন্তরস্থ বিষয়গুলোকে পরিষ্কার করেন, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ সকলের অন্তরের কথা সম্পর্কে বিশেষভাবে অবহিত।', 'Then after distress, He sent down upon you security [in the form of] drowsiness, overcoming a faction of you, while another faction worried about themselves, thinking of Allah other than the truth - the thought of ignorance, saying, "Is there anything for us [to have done] in this matter?" Say, "Indeed, the matter belongs completely to Allah." They conceal within themselves what they will not reveal to you. They say, "If there was anything we could have done in the matter, some of us would not have been killed right here." Say, "Even if you had been inside your houses, those decreed to be killed would have come out to their death beds." [It was] so that Allah might test what is in your breasts and purify what is in your hearts. And Allah is Knowing of that within the breasts.', 'অতঃপর কষ্টের পর আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতি শান্তি-তন্দ্রা প্রেরণ করলেন, যা তোমাদের একদলকে আচ্ছন্ন করল এবং অন্যদল মূর্খের মতো আল্লাহর প্রতি কুধারণা পোষণ করতঃ নিজেরাই নিজেদের জীবনকে উদ্বেগাকুল করে বলল, কাজ-কর্মের ব্যাপারে (সিদ্ধান্ত গ্রহণের) আমাদের কিছুমাত্র অধিকার আছে কি? বল, ‘সমস্তই আল্লাহর নিরঙ্কুশ অধিকারভুক্ত’। তারা এমন সব কথা অন্তরে পোষণ করে- যা তোমার কাছে প্রকাশ করে না। তারা বলে, ‘যদি মতামত প্রদানের অধিকার আমাদের কিছুমাত্রও থাকত, তাহলে আমরা এ স্থলে নিহত হতাম না’। বলে দাও, ‘যদি তোমরা তোমাদের ঘরেও থাকতে, তথাপি যাদের ভাগ্যে মৃত্যু লেখা ছিল, তারা তাদের এ মৃত্যুশয্যার পানে বের হয়ে পড়ত’। এবং এজন্যও যে আল্লাহ তোমাদের অন্তরের ভেতরের বিষয়গুলো পরীক্ষা করেন এবং তোমাদের অন্তরস্থ বিষয়গুলোকে পরিষ্কার করেন, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ সকলের অন্তরের কথা সম্পর্কে বিশেষভাবে অবহিত।', 'Then after distress, He sent down upon you security [in the form of] drowsiness, overcoming a faction of you, while another faction worried about themselves, thinking of Allah other than the truth - the thought of ignorance, saying, "Is there anything for us [to have done] in this matter?" Say, "Indeed, the matter belongs completely to Allah." They conceal within themselves what they will not reveal to you. They say, "If there was anything we could have done in the matter, some of us would not have been killed right here." Say, "Even if you had been inside your houses, those decreed to be killed would have come out to their death beds." [It was] so that Allah might test what is in your breasts and purify what is in your hearts. And Allah is Knowing of that within the breasts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003154.mp3', now()),
  (3, 155, '', '[{"id":81095,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81096,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81097,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"পিঠটান দিয়েছে","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81098,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81099,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":81100,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْتَقَى","transliteration":"l-taqā","translation_bn":"মুকাবিলার","root":"لقي","lemma":"ٱلْتَقَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81101,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَمْعَانِ","transliteration":"l-jamʿāni","translation_bn":"দুই দলের","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81102,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81103,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَزَلَّهُمُ","transliteration":"is''tazallahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে পদস্খলন ঘটিয়েছিল","root":"زلل","lemma":"ٱسْتَزَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81104,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81105,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعْضِ","transliteration":"bibaʿḍi","translation_bn":"কিছু জিনিসের কারণে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81106,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81107,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"kasabū","translation_bn":"তারা উপার্জন করেছিল","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81109,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81110,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَفَا","transliteration":"ʿafā","translation_bn":"মাফ করেছেন","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81111,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81112,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81114,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81115,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81116,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81117,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"حَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥalīmun","translation_bn":"বড় সহনশীল","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81118,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna tawallaw minkum yawma l-taqā l-jamʿāni innamā is''tazallahumu l-shayṭānu bibaʿḍi mā kasabū walaqad ʿafā l-lahu ʿanhum inna l-laha ghafūrun ḥalīmun', 'দু’দল পরস্পর সম্মুখীন হওয়ার দিন তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা পলায়নপর হয়েছিল, তোমাদের কোন কোন অতীত কার্যকলাপের জন্য শয়ত্বান তাদের পদস্খলন ঘটিয়েছিল এবং নিঃসন্দেহে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করেছেন; নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ ক্ষমাপরায়ণ, অতি সহনশীল।', 'Indeed, those of you who turned back on the day the two armies met, it was Satan who caused them to slip because of some [blame] they had earned. But Allah has already forgiven them. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Forbearing.', 'দু’দল পরস্পর সম্মুখীন হওয়ার দিন তোমাদের মধ্যে যারা পলায়নপর হয়েছিল, তোমাদের কোন কোন অতীত কার্যকলাপের জন্য শয়ত্বান তাদের পদস্খলন ঘটিয়েছিল এবং নিঃসন্দেহে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করেছেন; নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ ক্ষমাপরায়ণ, অতি সহনশীল।', 'Indeed, those of you who turned back on the day the two armies met, it was Satan who caused them to slip because of some [blame] they had earned. But Allah has already forgiven them. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Forbearing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003155.mp3', now()),
  (3, 156, '', '[{"id":81284,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"ওহে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":81285,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81286,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81287,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":81288,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"takūnū","translation_bn":"তোমরা হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81289,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"ka-alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) মতো যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81290,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"কুফরী করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81291,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"ও তারা বলেছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81292,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"li-ikh''wānihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাইদেরকে","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81293,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":81294,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبُوا۟","transliteration":"ḍarabū","translation_bn":"তারা ভ্রমণ করে","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81295,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81296,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দেশেবিদেশে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81297,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81298,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81299,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"غُزًّۭى","transliteration":"ghuzzan","translation_bn":"যুদ্ধে (শরিক)","root":"غزو","lemma":"غُزًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81300,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"''''যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":81301,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা থাকত","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81302,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عِندَنَا","transliteration":"ʿindanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":81303,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":81304,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"mātū","translation_bn":"তারা মরতো","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81305,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81306,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"قُتِلُوا۟","transliteration":"qutilū","translation_bn":"তারা নিহত হত''''","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81307,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لِيَجْعَلَ","transliteration":"liyajʿala","translation_bn":"(এরূপ হয়েছে) করেন যেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81308,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81309,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপ (কথাবার্তা)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":81310,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"حَسْرَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥasratan","translation_bn":"মনস্তাপের (কারণ)","root":"حسر","lemma":"حَسْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81311,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81312,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরগুলোর","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81314,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81315,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"يُحْىِۦ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"জীবন দেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81316,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"وَيُمِيتُ ۗ","transliteration":"wayumītu","translation_bn":"ও মৃত্যু দেন","root":"موت","lemma":"أَمَاتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81318,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81319,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81320,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81321,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"ভালোভাবে দেখছেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81322,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"١٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā takūnū ka-alladhīna kafarū waqālū li-ikh''wānihim idhā ḍarabū fī l-arḍi aw kānū ghuzzan law kānū ʿindanā mā mātū wamā qutilū liyajʿala l-lahu dhālika ḥasratan fī qulūbihim wal-lahu yuḥ''yī wayumītu wal-lahu bimā taʿmalūna baṣīrun', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা তাদের মত হয়ো না, যারা কুফরী করে এবং তাদের ভাই-বন্ধুগণ যখন বিদেশে সফর করে কিংবা কোথাও যুদ্ধে লিপ্ত হয় তাদের সম্বন্ধে বলে, ‘তারা আমাদের কাছে থাকলে মরত না, নিহতও হত না’। ফলে আল্লাহ এটিকে তাদের মনের অনুতাপে পরিণত করে দেন, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ্ই জীবিত করেন ও মৃত্যুদান করেন আর তোমরা যা কিছু কর, আল্লাহ তার সম্যক দ্রষ্টা।', 'O you who have believed, do not be like those who disbelieved and said about their brothers when they traveled through the land or went out to fight, "If they had been with us, they would not have died or have been killed," so Allah makes that [misconception] a regret within their hearts. And it is Allah who gives life and causes death, and Allah is Seeing of what you do.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমরা তাদের মত হয়ো না, যারা কুফরী করে এবং তাদের ভাই-বন্ধুগণ যখন বিদেশে সফর করে কিংবা কোথাও যুদ্ধে লিপ্ত হয় তাদের সম্বন্ধে বলে, ‘তারা আমাদের কাছে থাকলে মরত না, নিহতও হত না’। ফলে আল্লাহ এটিকে তাদের মনের অনুতাপে পরিণত করে দেন, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ্ই জীবিত করেন ও মৃত্যুদান করেন আর তোমরা যা কিছু কর, আল্লাহ তার সম্যক দ্রষ্টা।', 'O you who have believed, do not be like those who disbelieved and said about their brothers when they traveled through the land or went out to fight, "If they had been with us, they would not have died or have been killed," so Allah makes that [misconception] a regret within their hearts. And it is Allah who gives life and causes death, and Allah is Seeing of what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003156.mp3', now()),
  (3, 157, '', '[{"id":81323,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81324,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قُتِلْتُمْ","transliteration":"qutil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা নিহত হও","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81325,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81326,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81327,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81328,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81329,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُتُّمْ","transliteration":"muttum","translation_bn":"তোমরা মরে যাও","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81330,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَمَغْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"lamaghfiratun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা অবশ্যই","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":81331,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81332,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81333,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةٌ","transliteration":"waraḥmatun","translation_bn":"ও রহমাত","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81334,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81335,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81336,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَجْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yajmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জমা করেছ","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81337,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wala-in qutil''tum fī sabīli l-lahi aw muttum lamaghfiratun mina l-lahi waraḥmatun khayrun mimmā yajmaʿūna', 'যদি তোমরা আল্লাহর পথে নিহত হও কিংবা মৃত্যুবরণ কর, তবে আল্লাহর দয়া ও ক্ষমা অতি উত্তম তারা যা সঞ্চয় করে তার চেয়ে।', 'And if you are killed in the cause of Allah or die - then forgiveness from Allah and mercy are better than whatever they accumulate [in this world].', 'যদি তোমরা আল্লাহর পথে নিহত হও কিংবা মৃত্যুবরণ কর, তবে আল্লাহর দয়া ও ক্ষমা অতি উত্তম তারা যা সঞ্চয় করে তার চেয়ে।', 'And if you are killed in the cause of Allah or die - then forgiveness from Allah and mercy are better than whatever they accumulate [in this world].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003157.mp3', now()),
  (3, 158, '', '[{"id":81607,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَئِن","transliteration":"wala-in","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81608,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُّتُّمْ","transliteration":"muttum","translation_bn":"তোমরা মারা যাও","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81609,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81610,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُتِلْتُمْ","transliteration":"qutil''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা নিহত হও","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81611,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَإِلَى","transliteration":"la-ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":81612,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81613,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تُحْشَرُونَ","transliteration":"tuḥ''sharūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের একত্রিত করা হবে","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81614,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wala-in muttum aw qutil''tum la-ilā l-lahi tuḥ''sharūna', 'তোমরা মারা গেলে বা নিহত হলে অবশ্যই আল্লাহর নিকট তোমাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে।', 'And whether you die or are killed, unto Allah you will be gathered.', 'তোমরা মারা গেলে বা নিহত হলে অবশ্যই আল্লাহর নিকট তোমাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে।', 'And whether you die or are killed, unto Allah you will be gathered.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003158.mp3', now()),
  (3, 159, '', '[{"id":81706,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَبِمَا","transliteration":"fabimā","translation_bn":"বস্তুত কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81707,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"raḥmatin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81708,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81709,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81710,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِنتَ","transliteration":"linta","translation_bn":"তুমি নরম হয়েছ","root":"لين","lemma":"لِن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81711,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81713,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81714,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"তুমি হতে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81715,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَظًّا","transliteration":"faẓẓan","translation_bn":"উগ্র স্বভাব","root":"فظظ","lemma":"فَظّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81716,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَلِيظَ","transliteration":"ghalīẓa","translation_bn":"পাষাণ","root":"غلظ","lemma":"غَلِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81717,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَلْبِ","transliteration":"l-qalbi","translation_bn":"হৃদয়ের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81718,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَٱنفَضُّوا۟","transliteration":"la-infaḍḍū","translation_bn":"তারা অবশ্যই সরে যেত","root":"فضض","lemma":"ٱنفَضُّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":81719,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81720,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَوْلِكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥawlika","translation_bn":"তোমার চতুর্দিক","root":"حول","lemma":"حَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81722,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْفُ","transliteration":"fa-uʿ''fu","translation_bn":"অতএব মাফকর","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81723,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81724,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wa-is''taghfir","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা চাও","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81725,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81726,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَشَاوِرْهُمْ","transliteration":"washāwir''hum","translation_bn":"এবং পরামর্শ কর তাদের (সাথে)","root":"شور","lemma":"شَاوِرْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81727,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81728,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-amri","translation_bn":"কাজের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81730,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81731,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَزَمْتَ","transliteration":"ʿazamta","translation_bn":"তুমি সংকল্প কর","root":"عزم","lemma":"عَزَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81732,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَتَوَكَّلْ","transliteration":"fatawakkal","translation_bn":"তখন ভরসা কর","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":81733,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81734,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81736,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81737,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81738,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81739,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutawakilīna","translation_bn":"ভরসাকারীদেরকে","root":"وكل","lemma":"مُتَوَكِّلُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81740,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"١٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fabimā raḥmatin mina l-lahi linta lahum walaw kunta faẓẓan ghalīẓa l-qalbi la-infaḍḍū min ḥawlika fa-uʿ''fu ʿanhum wa-is''taghfir lahum washāwir''hum fī l-amri fa-idhā ʿazamta fatawakkal ʿalā l-lahi inna l-laha yuḥibbu l-mutawakilīna', 'সুতরাং আল্লাহর পরম অনুগ্রহ যে তুমি তাদের উপর দয়ার্দ্র রয়েছ, এবং যদি তুমি রূঢ় মেজাজ ও কঠিন হৃদয় হতে তবে অবশ্যই তারা তোমার নিকট হতে সরে যেত। সুতরাং তাদের দোষ ক্ষমা কর এবং আল্লাহর কাছে তাদের গুনাহের জন্য ক্ষমা চাও এবং কাজ-কর্মে তাদের সঙ্গে পরামর্শ কর, অতঃপর যখন (কোন ব্যাপারে) সংকল্পবদ্ধ হও, তখন আল্লাহরই প্রতি ভরসা কর; নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ ভরসাকারীদেরকে পছন্দ করেন।', 'So by mercy from Allah, [O Muhammad], you were lenient with them. And if you had been rude [in speech] and harsh in heart, they would have disbanded from about you. So pardon them and ask forgiveness for them and consult them in the matter. And when you have decided, then rely upon Allah. Indeed, Allah loves those who rely [upon Him].', 'সুতরাং আল্লাহর পরম অনুগ্রহ যে তুমি তাদের উপর দয়ার্দ্র রয়েছ, এবং যদি তুমি রূঢ় মেজাজ ও কঠিন হৃদয় হতে তবে অবশ্যই তারা তোমার নিকট হতে সরে যেত। সুতরাং তাদের দোষ ক্ষমা কর এবং আল্লাহর কাছে তাদের গুনাহের জন্য ক্ষমা চাও এবং কাজ-কর্মে তাদের সঙ্গে পরামর্শ কর, অতঃপর যখন (কোন ব্যাপারে) সংকল্পবদ্ধ হও, তখন আল্লাহরই প্রতি ভরসা কর; নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ ভরসাকারীদেরকে পছন্দ করেন।', 'So by mercy from Allah, [O Muhammad], you were lenient with them. And if you had been rude [in speech] and harsh in heart, they would have disbanded from about you. So pardon them and ask forgiveness for them and consult them in the matter. And when you have decided, then rely upon Allah. Indeed, Allah loves those who rely [upon Him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003159.mp3', now()),
  (3, 160, '', '[{"id":81777,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":81778,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرْكُمُ","transliteration":"yanṣur''kumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাহায্য করেন","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81779,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81780,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"না তবে","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":81781,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"غَالِبَ","transliteration":"ghāliba","translation_bn":"বিজয়ী হবে কেউ","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَالِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81782,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81784,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81785,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَخْذُلْكُمْ","transliteration":"yakhdhul''kum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের তিনি ত্যাগ করেন","root":"خذل","lemma":"يَخْذُلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81786,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"কে তবে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":81787,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذَا","transliteration":"dhā","translation_bn":"এমন","root":"—","lemma":"ذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":81788,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(আছে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81789,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُكُم","transliteration":"yanṣurukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের সাাহায্য করতে পারে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81790,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81791,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তারপরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81793,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"এবং উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81794,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81795,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","transliteration":"falyatawakkali","translation_bn":"ভরসা করা উচিত","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81796,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমানদারদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81797,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'in yanṣur''kumu l-lahu falā ghāliba lakum wa-in yakhdhul''kum faman dhā alladhī yanṣurukum min baʿdihi waʿalā l-lahi falyatawakkali l-mu''minūna', 'যদি আল্লাহ তোমাদের সাহায্য করেন, তবে তোমাদের উপর কেউই বিজয়ী হতে পারবে না এবং যদি তিনি তোমাদের সাহায্য না করেন, সে অবস্থায় এমন কে আছে যে, তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করবে? মু’মিনদের আল্লাহর প্রতি নির্ভর করাই উচিত।', 'If Allah should aid you, no one can overcome you; but if He should forsake you, who is there that can aid you after Him? And upon Allah let the believers rely.', 'যদি আল্লাহ তোমাদের সাহায্য করেন, তবে তোমাদের উপর কেউই বিজয়ী হতে পারবে না এবং যদি তিনি তোমাদের সাহায্য না করেন, সে অবস্থায় এমন কে আছে যে, তোমাদেরকে সাহায্য করবে? মু’মিনদের আল্লাহর প্রতি নির্ভর করাই উচিত।', 'If Allah should aid you, no one can overcome you; but if He should forsake you, who is there that can aid you after Him? And upon Allah let the believers rely.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003160.mp3', now()),
  (3, 161, '', '[{"id":81928,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81929,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(শোভনীয়) হতে পারে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81930,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِنَبِىٍّ","transliteration":"linabiyyin","translation_bn":"নবীর জন্য","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81931,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":81932,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَغُلَّ ۚ","transliteration":"yaghulla","translation_bn":"সে খিয়ানত করবে","root":"غلل","lemma":"غَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81934,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81935,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَغْلُلْ","transliteration":"yaghlul","translation_bn":"খিয়ানত করবে","root":"غلل","lemma":"غَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81936,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِ","transliteration":"yati","translation_bn":"সে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81937,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"তা নিয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81938,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَلَّ","transliteration":"ghalla","translation_bn":"খিয়ানত করেছিল","root":"غلل","lemma":"غَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81939,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81940,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"কিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81942,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81943,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تُوَفَّىٰ","transliteration":"tuwaffā","translation_bn":"দেয়া হবে পুরাপুরি","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81944,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81945,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81946,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81947,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَتْ","transliteration":"kasabat","translation_bn":"সে অর্জন করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81948,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":81949,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":81950,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"জুলুম করা হবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81951,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna linabiyyin an yaghulla waman yaghlul yati bimā ghalla yawma l-qiyāmati thumma tuwaffā kullu nafsin mā kasabat wahum lā yuẓ''lamūna', 'কোন নাবী খিয়ানাত করতে পারে না, যে ব্যক্তি খিয়ানাত করবে, সে খিয়ানাতকৃত বস্তুসহ ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন উপস্থিত হবে, অতঃপর প্রত্যেককে যা সে অর্জন করেছে তা পুরোপুরি দেয়া হবে, কারও প্রতি কোন প্রকার যুলম করা হবে না।', 'It is not [attributable] to any prophet that he would act unfaithfully [in regard to war booty]. And whoever betrays, [taking unlawfully], will come with what he took on the Day of Resurrection. Then will every soul be [fully] compensated for what it earned, and they will not be wronged.', 'কোন নাবী খিয়ানাত করতে পারে না, যে ব্যক্তি খিয়ানাত করবে, সে খিয়ানাতকৃত বস্তুসহ ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন উপস্থিত হবে, অতঃপর প্রত্যেককে যা সে অর্জন করেছে তা পুরোপুরি দেয়া হবে, কারও প্রতি কোন প্রকার যুলম করা হবে না।', 'It is not [attributable] to any prophet that he would act unfaithfully [in regard to war booty]. And whoever betrays, [taking unlawfully], will come with what he took on the Day of Resurrection. Then will every soul be [fully] compensated for what it earned, and they will not be wronged.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003161.mp3', now()),
  (3, 162, '', '[{"id":81974,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَنِ","transliteration":"afamani","translation_bn":"তবে কি যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":81975,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"ittabaʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করল","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81976,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رِضْوَٰنَ","transliteration":"riḍ''wāna","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্টির","root":"رضو","lemma":"رِضْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81977,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81978,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَمَنۢ","transliteration":"kaman","translation_bn":"তার মত যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81979,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَآءَ","transliteration":"bāa","translation_bn":"পরিবেষ্টিত হয়েছে","root":"بوا","lemma":"بَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81980,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِسَخَطٍۢ","transliteration":"bisakhaṭin","translation_bn":"অসন্তুষ্টি দ্বারা","root":"سخط","lemma":"سَخَط","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81981,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81982,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81983,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُ","transliteration":"wamawāhu","translation_bn":"এবং তার ঠিকানা","root":"اوي","lemma":"مَأْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81984,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمُ ۚ","transliteration":"jahannamu","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81986,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"wabi''sa","translation_bn":"এবং (তা) অতি খারাপ","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81987,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","translation_bn":"গন্তব্যস্থান","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81988,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afamani ittabaʿa riḍ''wāna l-lahi kaman bāa bisakhaṭin mina l-lahi wamawāhu jahannamu wabi''sa l-maṣīru', 'যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টি অনুসরণ করে, সে কি আল্লাহর আক্রোশে পতিত লোকের ন্যায় হতে পারে? তার নিবাস হল জাহান্নাম, আর তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল!', 'So is one who pursues the pleasure of Allah like one who brings upon himself the anger of Allah and whose refuge is Hell? And wretched is the destination.', 'যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টি অনুসরণ করে, সে কি আল্লাহর আক্রোশে পতিত লোকের ন্যায় হতে পারে? তার নিবাস হল জাহান্নাম, আর তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট প্রত্যাবর্তনস্থল!', 'So is one who pursues the pleasure of Allah like one who brings upon himself the anger of Allah and whose refuge is Hell? And wretched is the destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003162.mp3', now()),
  (3, 163, '', '[{"id":82146,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":82147,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٌ","transliteration":"darajātun","translation_bn":"মর্যাদার (এক নয়)","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82148,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":82149,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82151,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82152,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"খুব দেখেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82153,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82154,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82155,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hum darajātun ʿinda l-lahi wal-lahu baṣīrun bimā yaʿmalūna', 'আল্লাহর নিকট তাদের বিভিন্ন মর্যাদা রয়েছে, বস্তুতঃ তারা যা কিছুই করছে, আল্লাহ তার সম্যক দ্রষ্টা।', 'They are [varying] degrees in the sight of Allah, and Allah is Seeing of whatever they do.', 'আল্লাহর নিকট তাদের বিভিন্ন মর্যাদা রয়েছে, বস্তুতঃ তারা যা কিছুই করছে, আল্লাহ তার সম্যক দ্রষ্টা।', 'They are [varying] degrees in the sight of Allah, and Allah is Seeing of whatever they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003163.mp3', now()),
  (3, 164, '', '[{"id":82302,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":82303,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَنَّ","transliteration":"manna","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ করেছেন","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82304,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82305,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82306,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82307,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":82308,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَعَثَ","transliteration":"baʿatha","translation_bn":"প্রেরণ করেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82309,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِمْ","transliteration":"fīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82310,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","transliteration":"rasūlan","translation_bn":"একজন রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82311,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82312,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82313,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَتْلُوا۟","transliteration":"yatlū","translation_bn":"সে পাঠ করে","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82314,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82315,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর নিদর্শনগুলো","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82316,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ","transliteration":"wayuzakkīhim","translation_bn":"ও পরিশুদ্ধ করে তাদেরকে","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82317,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ","transliteration":"wayuʿallimuhumu","translation_bn":"এবং শিক্ষা দেয় তাদেরকে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82318,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82319,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ","transliteration":"wal-ḥik''mata","translation_bn":"ও প্রজ্ঞা","root":"حكم","lemma":"حِكْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82320,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":82321,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82322,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82323,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতিপূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82324,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":82325,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তির","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82326,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82327,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad manna l-lahu ʿalā l-mu''minīna idh baʿatha fīhim rasūlan min anfusihim yatlū ʿalayhim āyātihi wayuzakkīhim wayuʿallimuhumu l-kitāba wal-ḥik''mata wa-in kānū min qablu lafī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ মু’মিনদের প্রতি অত্যন্ত অনুকম্পা প্রদর্শন করেছেন, যখন তাদের নিকট তাদের নিজস্ব একজনকে রসূল করে পাঠিয়েছেন, সে তাদেরকে আল্লাহর আয়াত পড়ে শুনাচ্ছে, তাদেরকে পরিশোধন করছে, তাদেরকে কিতাব ও হিকমাত (সুন্নাহ) শিক্ষা দিচ্ছে, যদিও তারা পূর্বে সুস্পষ্ট গোমরাহীতে ছিল।', 'Certainly did Allah confer [great] favor upon the believers when He sent among them a Messenger from themselves, reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book and wisdom, although they had been before in manifest error.', 'নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ মু’মিনদের প্রতি অত্যন্ত অনুকম্পা প্রদর্শন করেছেন, যখন তাদের নিকট তাদের নিজস্ব একজনকে রসূল করে পাঠিয়েছেন, সে তাদেরকে আল্লাহর আয়াত পড়ে শুনাচ্ছে, তাদেরকে পরিশোধন করছে, তাদেরকে কিতাব ও হিকমাত (সুন্নাহ) শিক্ষা দিচ্ছে, যদিও তারা পূর্বে সুস্পষ্ট গোমরাহীতে ছিল।', 'Certainly did Allah confer [great] favor upon the believers when He sent among them a Messenger from themselves, reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book and wisdom, although they had been before in manifest error.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003164.mp3', now()),
  (3, 165, '', '[{"id":82430,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"awalammā","translation_bn":"না কি যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":82431,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَصَـٰبَتْكُم","transliteration":"aṣābatkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে পৌঁছে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82432,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُّصِيبَةٌۭ","transliteration":"muṣībatun","translation_bn":"কোন মুসিবত","root":"صوب","lemma":"مُّصِيبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82433,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"(অথচ) নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":82434,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَصَبْتُم","transliteration":"aṣabtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা পৌঁছেছো (তাদের মুসিবতে)","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82435,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلَيْهَا","transliteration":"mith''layhā","translation_bn":"তার দ্বিগুণ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82436,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُلْتُمْ","transliteration":"qul''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলেছিলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82437,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"কোথা থেকে","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":82438,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا ۖ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"''''এটা (আসল)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":82440,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"তুমি বল''''","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82441,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তা (এসেছে)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":82442,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"''''থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82443,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عِندِ","transliteration":"ʿindi","translation_bn":"কাছ","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82444,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"anfusikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নিজেদের''''","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82446,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82447,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82448,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82449,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82450,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82451,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমতাবান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82452,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalammā aṣābatkum muṣībatun qad aṣabtum mith''layhā qul''tum annā hādhā qul huwa min ʿindi anfusikum inna l-laha ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'কী ব্যাপার! তোমাদের উপর যখন বিপদ এসেছে অথচ তোমরা তো (বদর যুদ্ধে তোমাদের শত্রুদের) এটা অপেক্ষা দ্বিগুণ বিপদ ঘটিয়েছিলে, এখন তোমরা বলছ, ‘এটা কোথেকে আসল’? (তাদেরকে) বল, ‘ওটা তোমাদের নিজেদের নিকট থেকেই এসেছে’, নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ সকল বস্তুর উপর ক্ষমতাবান।', 'Why [is it that] when a [single] disaster struck you [on the day of Uhud], although you had struck [the enemy in the battle of Badr] with one twice as great, you said, "From where is this?" Say, "It is from yourselves." Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.', 'কী ব্যাপার! তোমাদের উপর যখন বিপদ এসেছে অথচ তোমরা তো (বদর যুদ্ধে তোমাদের শত্রুদের) এটা অপেক্ষা দ্বিগুণ বিপদ ঘটিয়েছিলে, এখন তোমরা বলছ, ‘এটা কোথেকে আসল’? (তাদেরকে) বল, ‘ওটা তোমাদের নিজেদের নিকট থেকেই এসেছে’, নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ সকল বস্তুর উপর ক্ষমতাবান।', 'Why [is it that] when a [single] disaster struck you [on the day of Uhud], although you had struck [the enemy in the battle of Badr] with one twice as great, you said, "From where is this?" Say, "It is from yourselves." Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003165.mp3', now()),
  (3, 166, '', '[{"id":82453,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা (মুসিবত)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82454,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَصَـٰبَكُمْ","transliteration":"aṣābakum","translation_bn":"পৌঁছেছে তোমাদের","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82455,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":82456,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْتَقَى","transliteration":"l-taqā","translation_bn":"মুকাবিলার","root":"لقي","lemma":"ٱلْتَقَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82457,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَمْعَانِ","transliteration":"l-jamʿāni","translation_bn":"দুই দলের","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82458,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَبِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"fabi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"তা (এসেছে) অনুমতিক্রমে","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":82459,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82460,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি যেন জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82461,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদেরকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82462,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā aṣābakum yawma l-taqā l-jamʿāni fabi-idh''ni l-lahi waliyaʿlama l-mu''minīna', 'দু’দল পরস্পরের সম্মুখীন হওয়ার দিন যে বিপদ পৌঁছেছিল, তা আল্লাহর হুকুমে ঘটেছিল, এর উদ্দেশ্য ছিল প্রকৃত মু’মিনদেরকে জেনে নেয়া।', 'And what struck you on the day the two armies met was by permission of Allah that He might make evident the [true] believers.', 'দু’দল পরস্পরের সম্মুখীন হওয়ার দিন যে বিপদ পৌঁছেছিল, তা আল্লাহর হুকুমে ঘটেছিল, এর উদ্দেশ্য ছিল প্রকৃত মু’মিনদেরকে জেনে নেয়া।', 'And what struck you on the day the two armies met was by permission of Allah that He might make evident the [true] believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003166.mp3', now()),
