চেয়ে","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82622,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে (এমন কথা)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82623,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِأَفْوَٰهِهِم","transliteration":"bi-afwāhihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মুখগুলো দিয়ে","root":"فوه","lemma":"أَفْوَٰه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82624,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82625,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নাই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82626,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82627,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অন্তরে","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82629,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82630,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82631,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82632,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"يَكْتُمُونَ","transliteration":"yaktumūna","translation_bn":"তারা গোপন করেছে","root":"كتم","lemma":"كَتَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82633,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"١٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waliyaʿlama alladhīna nāfaqū waqīla lahum taʿālaw qātilū fī sabīli l-lahi awi id''faʿū qālū law naʿlamu qitālan la-ittabaʿnākum hum lil''kuf''ri yawma-idhin aqrabu min''hum lil''īmāni yaqūlūna bi-afwāhihim mā laysa fī qulūbihim wal-lahu aʿlamu bimā yaktumūna', 'আর মুনাফিকদেরকেও জেনে নেয়া। তাদেরকে বলা হয়েছিল; এসো, ‘আল্লাহর পথে যুদ্ধ কর, কিংবা (কমপক্ষে) নিজেদের প্রতিরক্ষার ব্যবস্থা কর’। তখন তারা বলল, ‘যদি আমরা জানতাম যুদ্ধ হবে, তাহলে অবশ্যই তোমাদের অনুসরণ করতাম’। তারা ঐ দিন ঈমানের চেয়ে কুফরীরই নিকটতম ছিল, তারা মুখে এমন কথা বলে যা তাদের অন্তরে নেই, যা কিছু তারা গোপন করে আল্লাহ তা বিশেষরূপে জ্ঞাত আছেন।', 'And that He might make evident those who are hypocrites. For it was said to them, "Come, fight in the way of Allah or [at least] defend." They said, "If we had known [there would be] fighting, we would have followed you." They were nearer to disbelief that day than to faith, saying with their mouths what was not in their hearts. And Allah is most Knowing of what they conceal -', 'আর মুনাফিকদেরকেও জেনে নেয়া। তাদেরকে বলা হয়েছিল; এসো, ‘আল্লাহর পথে যুদ্ধ কর, কিংবা (কমপক্ষে) নিজেদের প্রতিরক্ষার ব্যবস্থা কর’। তখন তারা বলল, ‘যদি আমরা জানতাম যুদ্ধ হবে, তাহলে অবশ্যই তোমাদের অনুসরণ করতাম’। তারা ঐ দিন ঈমানের চেয়ে কুফরীরই নিকটতম ছিল, তারা মুখে এমন কথা বলে যা তাদের অন্তরে নেই, যা কিছু তারা গোপন করে আল্লাহ তা বিশেষরূপে জ্ঞাত আছেন।', 'And that He might make evident those who are hypocrites. For it was said to them, "Come, fight in the way of Allah or [at least] defend." They said, "If we had known [there would be] fighting, we would have followed you." They were nearer to disbelief that day than to faith, saying with their mouths what was not in their hearts. And Allah is most Knowing of what they conceal -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003167.mp3', now()),
  (3, 168, '', '[{"id":82677,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82678,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82679,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"li-ikh''wānihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাইদের সম্পর্কে","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82680,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَقَعَدُوا۟","transliteration":"waqaʿadū","translation_bn":"ও তারা বসে ছিল (ঘরে)","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":82681,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"''''যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":82682,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَطَاعُونَا","transliteration":"aṭāʿūnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের আনুগত্য করত","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82683,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":82684,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُتِلُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"qutilū","translation_bn":"তারা নিহত হতো''''","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82686,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82687,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱدْرَءُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-id''raū","translation_bn":"''''তোমরা তাহলে দূরে সরাও","root":"درا","lemma":"يَدْرَؤُا@","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":82688,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82689,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِكُمُ","transliteration":"anfusikumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের নিজেদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82690,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَ","transliteration":"l-mawta","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82691,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":82692,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82693,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82694,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna qālū li-ikh''wānihim waqaʿadū law aṭāʿūnā mā qutilū qul fa-id''raū ʿan anfusikumu l-mawta in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'যারা বসে থেকে নিজেদের ভাইদের সম্বন্ধে বলতে লাগল, আমাদের কথামত চললে তারা নিহত হত না। বল, তোমরা সত্যবাদী হলে তোমাদের নিজেদের উপর থেকে মরণকে হটিয়ে দাও।', 'Those who said about their brothers while sitting [at home], "If they had obeyed us, they would not have been killed." Say, "Then prevent death from yourselves, if you should be truthful."', 'যারা বসে থেকে নিজেদের ভাইদের সম্বন্ধে বলতে লাগল, আমাদের কথামত চললে তারা নিহত হত না। বল, তোমরা সত্যবাদী হলে তোমাদের নিজেদের উপর থেকে মরণকে হটিয়ে দাও।', 'Those who said about their brothers while sitting [at home], "If they had obeyed us, they would not have been killed." Say, "Then prevent death from yourselves, if you should be truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003168.mp3', now()),
  (3, 169, '', '[{"id":82737,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82738,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَحْسَبَنَّ","transliteration":"taḥsabanna","translation_bn":"মনে করো","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82739,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82740,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُتِلُوا۟","transliteration":"qutilū","translation_bn":"নিহত হয়েছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82741,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82742,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82743,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82744,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰتًۢا ۚ","transliteration":"amwātan","translation_bn":"(তারা) মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82746,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":82747,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَحْيَآءٌ","transliteration":"aḥyāon","translation_bn":"তারা জীবিত","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82748,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":82749,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82750,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُرْزَقُونَ","transliteration":"yur''zaqūna","translation_bn":"তাদের রিয্ক‌ দেয়া হয়","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82751,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā taḥsabanna alladhīna qutilū fī sabīli l-lahi amwātan bal aḥyāon ʿinda rabbihim yur''zaqūna', 'যারা আল্লাহর পথে নিহত হয়েছে, তাদেরকে মৃত ভেব না, বরং তারা জীবিত, তাদের প্রতিপালকের সান্নিধ্যে থেকে তারা রিযকপ্রাপ্ত হচ্ছে।', 'And never think of those who have been killed in the cause of Allah as dead. Rather, they are alive with their Lord, receiving provision,', 'যারা আল্লাহর পথে নিহত হয়েছে, তাদেরকে মৃত ভেব না, বরং তারা জীবিত, তাদের প্রতিপালকের সান্নিধ্যে থেকে তারা রিযকপ্রাপ্ত হচ্ছে।', 'And never think of those who have been killed in the cause of Allah as dead. Rather, they are alive with their Lord, receiving provision,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003169.mp3', now()),
  (3, 170, '', '[{"id":82819,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحِينَ","transliteration":"fariḥīna","translation_bn":"তারা খুশী হয়েছে","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82820,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82821,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"ātāhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের দিয়েছেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82822,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82823,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82824,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহে","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82825,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","transliteration":"wayastabshirūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা আনন্দিত হবে (এসব জেনে)","root":"بشر","lemma":"يَسْتَبْشِرُ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":82826,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্য যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82827,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নাই","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":82828,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَلْحَقُوا۟","transliteration":"yalḥaqū","translation_bn":"মিলিত হয়","root":"لحق","lemma":"يَلْحَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82829,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِم","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"তাদের সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82830,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82831,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَلْفِهِمْ","transliteration":"khalfihim","translation_bn":"তাদের পিছনে (রয়ে গেছে এখনো)","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82832,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":82833,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفٌ","transliteration":"khawfun","translation_bn":"কোন ভয় (আছে)","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82834,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82835,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82836,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":82837,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزَنُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","translation_bn":"দুঃখিত হবে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82838,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fariḥīna bimā ātāhumu l-lahu min faḍlihi wayastabshirūna bi-alladhīna lam yalḥaqū bihim min khalfihim allā khawfun ʿalayhim walā hum yaḥzanūna', 'আল্লাহ নিজ অনুগ্রহে তাদেরকে যা দিয়েছেন তা লাভ করে তারা আনন্দিত আর যে সব ঈমানদার লোক তাদের পেছনে (পৃথিবীতে) রয়ে গেছে, এখনও তাদের সাথে এসে মিলিত হয়নি, তাদের কোন ভয় ও চিন্তে নেই জেনে তারা আনন্দিত।', 'Rejoicing in what Allah has bestowed upon them of His bounty, and they receive good tidings about those [to be martyred] after them who have not yet joined them - that there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.', 'আল্লাহ নিজ অনুগ্রহে তাদেরকে যা দিয়েছেন তা লাভ করে তারা আনন্দিত আর যে সব ঈমানদার লোক তাদের পেছনে (পৃথিবীতে) রয়ে গেছে, এখনও তাদের সাথে এসে মিলিত হয়নি, তাদের কোন ভয় ও চিন্তে নেই জেনে তারা আনন্দিত।', 'Rejoicing in what Allah has bestowed upon them of His bounty, and they receive good tidings about those [to be martyred] after them who have not yet joined them - that there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003170.mp3', now()),
  (3, 171, '', '[{"id":82993,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastabshirūna","translation_bn":"তারা আনন্দিত হবে","root":"بشر","lemma":"يَسْتَبْشِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82994,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِنِعْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biniʿ''matin","translation_bn":"নিয়ামতের কারণে","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82995,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82996,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82997,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَفَضْلٍۢ","transliteration":"wafaḍlin","translation_bn":"ও অনুগ্রহে","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82998,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82999,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83000,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83001,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُضِيعُ","transliteration":"yuḍīʿu","translation_bn":"নষ্ট করেন","root":"ضيع","lemma":"أَضَاعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83002,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَ","transliteration":"ajra","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83003,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"ঈমানদারদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83004,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yastabshirūna biniʿ''matin mina l-lahi wafaḍlin wa-anna l-laha lā yuḍīʿu ajra l-mu''minīna', 'আল্লাহর নি‘মাত এবং অনুগ্রহের কারণে তারা আনন্দ প্রকাশ করে আর এটা জেনে যে, আল্লাহ মু’মিনদের সাওয়াব বিনষ্ট করেন না।', 'They receive good tidings of favor from Allah and bounty and [of the fact] that Allah does not allow the reward of believers to be lost -', 'আল্লাহর নি‘মাত এবং অনুগ্রহের কারণে তারা আনন্দ প্রকাশ করে আর এটা জেনে যে, আল্লাহ মু’মিনদের সাওয়াব বিনষ্ট করেন না।', 'They receive good tidings of favor from Allah and bounty and [of the fact] that Allah does not allow the reward of believers to be lost -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003171.mp3', now()),
  (3, 172, '', '[{"id":83079,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83080,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَجَابُوا۟","transliteration":"is''tajābū","translation_bn":"সাড়া দেয়","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83081,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83082,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"wal-rasūli","translation_bn":"ও রাসূলের (ডাকে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83083,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83084,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"এরপরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83085,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":83086,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَصَابَهُمُ","transliteration":"aṣābahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের পৌঁছেছে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83087,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَرْحُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-qarḥu","translation_bn":"আঘাত","root":"قرح","lemma":"قَرْح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83089,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83090,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنُوا۟","transliteration":"aḥsanū","translation_bn":"নেকী করেছে (যারা)","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83091,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83092,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقَوْا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqaw","translation_bn":"ও ভয় করেছে (আল্লাহকে)","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83093,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٌ","transliteration":"ajrun","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার (রয়েছে)","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83094,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"বিরাট","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83095,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna is''tajābū lillahi wal-rasūli min baʿdi mā aṣābahumu l-qarḥu lilladhīna aḥsanū min''hum wa-ittaqaw ajrun ʿaẓīmun', 'আঘাতপ্রাপ্ত হওয়ার পরও যারা আল্লাহ এবং রসূলের ডাকে সাড়া দিয়েছে তাদের মধ্যে যারা সৎকাজ করে ও তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে মহা প্রতিদান।', 'Those [believers] who responded to Allah and the Messenger after injury had struck them. For those who did good among them and feared Allah is a great reward -', 'আঘাতপ্রাপ্ত হওয়ার পরও যারা আল্লাহ এবং রসূলের ডাকে সাড়া দিয়েছে তাদের মধ্যে যারা সৎকাজ করে ও তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে মহা প্রতিদান।', 'Those [believers] who responded to Allah and the Messenger after injury had struck them. For those who did good among them and feared Allah is a great reward -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003172.mp3', now()),
  (3, 173, '', '[{"id":83189,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(এমন) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83190,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83191,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83192,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"লোকেরা","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83193,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"''''নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83194,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"সব লোক (অর্থাৎ বড় বাহিনী)","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83195,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":83196,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَمَعُوا۟","transliteration":"jamaʿū","translation_bn":"জমা হয়েছে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83197,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83198,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱخْشَوْهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-ikh''shawhum","translation_bn":"তাই ভয় কর তাদেরকে''''","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83199,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَزَادَهُمْ","transliteration":"fazādahum","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তাদের বেড়ে গেল","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83200,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"īmānan","translation_bn":"ঈমান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83201,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83202,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَسْبُنَا","transliteration":"ḥasbunā","translation_bn":"''''আমাদের জন্য যথেষ্ট","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83203,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83204,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَنِعْمَ","transliteration":"waniʿ''ma","translation_bn":"এবং (তিনিই) উত্তম","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83205,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَكِيلُ","transliteration":"l-wakīlu","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক''''","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83206,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna qāla lahumu l-nāsu inna l-nāsa qad jamaʿū lakum fa-ikh''shawhum fazādahum īmānan waqālū ḥasbunā l-lahu waniʿ''ma l-wakīlu', 'যাদেরকে লোকে খবর দিয়েছিল যে, একটা বড় বাহিনী তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে জড় হচ্ছে, কাজেই তাদেরকে ভয় কর। তখন তা তাদের ঈমান বৃদ্ধি করে দিল এবং তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের জন্যে আল্লাহ্ই যথেষ্ট এবং তিনি কতই না উত্তম কর্মবিধায়ক!’', 'Those to whom hypocrites said, "Indeed, the people have gathered against you, so fear them." But it [merely] increased them in faith, and they said, "Sufficient for us is Allah, and [He is] the best Disposer of affairs."', 'যাদেরকে লোকে খবর দিয়েছিল যে, একটা বড় বাহিনী তোমাদের বিরুদ্ধে জড় হচ্ছে, কাজেই তাদেরকে ভয় কর। তখন তা তাদের ঈমান বৃদ্ধি করে দিল এবং তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের জন্যে আল্লাহ্ই যথেষ্ট এবং তিনি কতই না উত্তম কর্মবিধায়ক!’', 'Those to whom hypocrites said, "Indeed, the people have gathered against you, so fear them." But it [merely] increased them in faith, and they said, "Sufficient for us is Allah, and [He is] the best Disposer of affairs."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003173.mp3', now()),
  (3, 174, '', '[{"id":83269,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-inqalabū","translation_bn":"তারা ফলে ফিরে এল","root":"قلب","lemma":"ٱنقَلَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83270,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِنِعْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"biniʿ''matin","translation_bn":"অবদানে","root":"نعم","lemma":"نِعْمَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83271,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83272,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83273,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَفَضْلٍۢ","transliteration":"wafaḍlin","translation_bn":"ও (তাঁর) অনুগ্রহে","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83274,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নাই","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83275,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَمْسَسْهُمْ","transliteration":"yamsashum","translation_bn":"তাদের স্পর্শ করে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83276,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءٌۭ","transliteration":"sūon","translation_bn":"কোন অকল্যাণ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83277,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা অনুসরণ করেছিল","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83278,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رِضْوَٰنَ","transliteration":"riḍ''wāna","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্টির","root":"رضو","lemma":"رِضْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83279,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83281,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83282,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"(একটি)","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83283,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلٍ","transliteration":"faḍlin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহশীল","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83284,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٍ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","translation_bn":"মহান","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83285,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-inqalabū biniʿ''matin mina l-lahi wafaḍlin lam yamsashum sūon wa-ittabaʿū riḍ''wāna l-lahi wal-lahu dhū faḍlin ʿaẓīmin', 'অতঃপর তারা আল্লাহর নি‘মাত ও অনুগ্রহসহ ফিরে আসল, কোনও প্রকার অনিষ্ট তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করেনি, তারা আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টির অনুসরণ করেছিল এবং আল্লাহ মহাকল্যাণময়।', 'So they returned with favor from Allah and bounty, no harm having touched them. And they pursued the pleasure of Allah, and Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', 'অতঃপর তারা আল্লাহর নি‘মাত ও অনুগ্রহসহ ফিরে আসল, কোনও প্রকার অনিষ্ট তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করেনি, তারা আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টির অনুসরণ করেছিল এবং আল্লাহ মহাকল্যাণময়।', 'So they returned with favor from Allah and bounty, no harm having touched them. And they pursued the pleasure of Allah, and Allah is the possessor of great bounty.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003174.mp3', now()),
  (3, 175, '', '[{"id":83311,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83312,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":83313,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তানই","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83314,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُخَوِّفُ","transliteration":"yukhawwifu","translation_bn":"ভয় দেখায়","root":"خوف","lemma":"يُخَوِّفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83315,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءَهُۥ","transliteration":"awliyāahu","translation_bn":"তার বন্ধুদেরকে","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83316,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83317,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَخَافُوهُمْ","transliteration":"takhāfūhum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় কর তাদেরকে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83318,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَخَافُونِ","transliteration":"wakhāfūni","translation_bn":"বরং আমাকেই তোমরা ভয় কর","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83319,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":83320,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83321,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83322,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā dhālikumu l-shayṭānu yukhawwifu awliyāahu falā takhāfūhum wakhāfūni in kuntum mu''minīna', 'এ লোকেরা হচ্ছে শয়ত্বান; তোমাদেরকে তার বন্ধুদের ভয় দেখায়, তোমরা তাদেরকে ভয় করো না, আমাকেই ভয় কর, যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হও।', 'That is only Satan who frightens [you] of his supporters. So fear them not, but fear Me, if you are [indeed] believers.', 'এ লোকেরা হচ্ছে শয়ত্বান; তোমাদেরকে তার বন্ধুদের ভয় দেখায়, তোমরা তাদেরকে ভয় করো না, আমাকেই ভয় কর, যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হও।', 'That is only Satan who frightens [you] of his supporters. So fear them not, but fear Me, if you are [indeed] believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003175.mp3', now()),
  (3, 176, '', '[{"id":83476,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83477,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزُنكَ","transliteration":"yaḥzunka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে (যেন) চিন্তিত করে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83478,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83479,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُسَـٰرِعُونَ","transliteration":"yusāriʿūna","translation_bn":"তৎপর হয়েছে","root":"سرع","lemma":"يُسَٰرِعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83480,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83481,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفْرِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-kuf''ri","translation_bn":"কুফরীর","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83483,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"তারা নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83484,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কক্ষনো না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83485,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّوا۟","transliteration":"yaḍurrū","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি করতে পারবে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83486,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83487,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۗ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্রও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83489,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83490,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83491,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":83492,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَجْعَلَ","transliteration":"yajʿala","translation_bn":"রাখবেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83493,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83494,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"حَظًّۭا","transliteration":"ḥaẓẓan","translation_bn":"কোন অংশ","root":"حظظ","lemma":"حَظّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83495,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83496,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83498,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের জন্য রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83499,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83500,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"বড় কঠিন","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83501,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yaḥzunka alladhīna yusāriʿūna fī l-kuf''ri innahum lan yaḍurrū l-laha shayan yurīdu l-lahu allā yajʿala lahum ḥaẓẓan fī l-ākhirati walahum ʿadhābun ʿaẓīmun', 'যারা কুফরীর দিকে দ্রুত ধাবমান তারা যেন তোমাকে মর্মপীড়া না দেয়। তারা কক্ষনো আল্লাহর কিছুই ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। পরকালে কোন অংশই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দিতে ইচ্ছে করেন না, তাদের জন্য আছে মহাশাস্তি।', 'And do not be grieved, [O Muhammad], by those who hasten into disbelief. Indeed, they will never harm Allah at all. Allah intends that He should give them no share in the Hereafter, and for them is a great punishment.', 'যারা কুফরীর দিকে দ্রুত ধাবমান তারা যেন তোমাকে মর্মপীড়া না দেয়। তারা কক্ষনো আল্লাহর কিছুই ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। পরকালে কোন অংশই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দিতে ইচ্ছে করেন না, তাদের জন্য আছে মহাশাস্তি।', 'And do not be grieved, [O Muhammad], by those who hasten into disbelief. Indeed, they will never harm Allah at all. Allah intends that He should give them no share in the Hereafter, and for them is a great punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003176.mp3', now()),
  (3, 177, '', '[{"id":83570,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83571,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83572,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱشْتَرَوُا۟","transliteration":"ish''tarawū","translation_bn":"ক্রয় করেছে","root":"شري","lemma":"ٱشْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83573,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفْرَ","transliteration":"l-kuf''ra","translation_bn":"কুফরীকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83574,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ","transliteration":"bil-īmāni","translation_bn":"ঈমানের বদলে","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83575,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কক্ষনো না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83576,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّوا۟","transliteration":"yaḍurrū","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি করতে পারবে","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83577,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83578,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্রও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83579,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের জন্য রয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83580,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83581,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"বড়ই কষ্টদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83582,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna ish''tarawū l-kuf''ra bil-īmāni lan yaḍurrū l-laha shayan walahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'যারা ঈমানের বিনিময়ে কুফরী ক্রয় করেছে, তারা কক্ষনো আল্লাহর কিছুমাত্র অনিষ্ট করতে পারবে না, তাদের জন্য আছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who purchase disbelief [in exchange] for faith - never will they harm Allah at all, and for them is a painful punishment.', 'যারা ঈমানের বিনিময়ে কুফরী ক্রয় করেছে, তারা কক্ষনো আল্লাহর কিছুমাত্র অনিষ্ট করতে পারবে না, তাদের জন্য আছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who purchase disbelief [in exchange] for faith - never will they harm Allah at all, and for them is a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003177.mp3', now()),
  (3, 178, '', '[{"id":83664,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83665,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْسَبَنَّ","transliteration":"yaḥsabanna","translation_bn":"(যেন) তারা মনে করে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83666,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83667,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"কুফরী করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83668,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَا","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"এই যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83669,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُمْلِى","transliteration":"num''lī","translation_bn":"আমরা ঢিল দিই","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83670,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83671,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83672,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"li-anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের জন্য","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83674,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83675,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"نُمْلِى","transliteration":"num''lī","translation_bn":"আমরা ঢিল দিই","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83676,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83677,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِيَزْدَادُوٓا۟","transliteration":"liyazdādū","translation_bn":"তারা বৃদ্ধি করে যেন","root":"زيد","lemma":"ٱزْدَادُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83678,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِثْمًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ith''man","translation_bn":"পাপ","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83680,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের জন্য (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83681,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83682,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُّهِينٌۭ","transliteration":"muhīnun","translation_bn":"বড় অপমানকর","root":"هون","lemma":"مُّهِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83683,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yaḥsabanna alladhīna kafarū annamā num''lī lahum khayrun li-anfusihim innamā num''lī lahum liyazdādū ith''man walahum ʿadhābun muhīnun', 'কাফিরগণ যেন কিছুতেই এ ধারণা পোষণ না করে যে, তাদেরকে আমি যে অবকাশ দিয়েছি তা তাদের জন্য মঙ্গলজনক; আমি তাদেরকে শুধু এজন্য অবকাশ দেই যে, যেন তাদের পাপের পরিমাণ বেড়ে যায়, তাদের জন্য আছে লাঞ্ছনাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'And let not those who disbelieve ever think that [because] We extend their time [of enjoyment] it is better for them. We only extend it for them so that they may increase in sin, and for them is a humiliating punishment.', 'কাফিরগণ যেন কিছুতেই এ ধারণা পোষণ না করে যে, তাদেরকে আমি যে অবকাশ দিয়েছি তা তাদের জন্য মঙ্গলজনক; আমি তাদেরকে শুধু এজন্য অবকাশ দেই যে, যেন তাদের পাপের পরিমাণ বেড়ে যায়, তাদের জন্য আছে লাঞ্ছনাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'And let not those who disbelieve ever think that [because] We extend their time [of enjoyment] it is better for them. We only extend it for them so that they may increase in sin, and for them is a humiliating punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003178.mp3', now()),
  (3, 179, '', '[{"id":83684,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83685,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(পদ্ধতি)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83686,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83687,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِيَذَرَ","transliteration":"liyadhara","translation_bn":"যে ছেড়ে দিবেন","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83688,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদেরকে (এমনি)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83689,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83690,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83691,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা (আছ)","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":83692,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83693,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83694,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَمِيزَ","transliteration":"yamīza","translation_bn":"পৃথক করবেন","root":"ميز","lemma":"يَمِيزَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83695,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَبِيثَ","transliteration":"l-khabītha","translation_bn":"নাপাক (অসৎ লোকদের)","root":"خبث","lemma":"خَبِيث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83696,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83697,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّيِّبِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ṭayibi","translation_bn":"পাক (সৎ লোকদের)","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83699,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83700,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(পদ্ধতি)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83701,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83702,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لِيُطْلِعَكُمْ","transliteration":"liyuṭ''liʿakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের খবর দেয়া","root":"طلع","lemma":"يُطْلِعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83703,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83704,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"গায়েবের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83705,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83706,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83707,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَجْتَبِى","transliteration":"yajtabī","translation_bn":"বাছাই করে নেন","root":"جبي","lemma":"ٱجْتَبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83708,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83709,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"رُّسُلِهِۦ","transliteration":"rusulihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসূলগণের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83710,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83711,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۖ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি চান","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83713,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"faāminū","translation_bn":"তোমরা তাই ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83714,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83715,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"warusulihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলদের (উপর)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83717,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83718,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"tu''minū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83719,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"وَتَتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"watattaqū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা ভয় কর","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83720,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"فَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"falakum","translation_bn":"তবে তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83721,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرٌ","transliteration":"ajrun","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার (রয়েছে)","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83722,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"বিরাট","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83723,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"١٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā kāna l-lahu liyadhara l-mu''minīna ʿalā mā antum ʿalayhi ḥattā yamīza l-khabītha mina l-ṭayibi wamā kāna l-lahu liyuṭ''liʿakum ʿalā l-ghaybi walākinna l-laha yajtabī min rusulihi man yashāu faāminū bil-lahi warusulihi wa-in tu''minū watattaqū falakum ajrun ʿaẓīmun', 'অসৎকে সৎ থেকে পৃথক না করা পর্যন্ত তোমরা যে অবস্থায় আছ, আল্লাহ মু’মিনদেরকে সে অবস্থায় ছেড়ে দিতে পারেন না এবং আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে গায়িবের বিধান জ্ঞাত করেন না, তবে আল্লাহ তাঁর রাসূলগণের মধ্যে যাকে ইচ্ছে বেছে নেন, কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহ এবং তাঁর রসূলগণের প্রতি ঈমান আন। যদি তোমরা ঈমান আন আর তাকওয়া অবলম্বন কর, তাহলে তোমাদের জন্য আছে মহাপুরস্কার।', 'Allah would not leave the believers in that [state] you are in [presently] until He separates the evil from the good. Nor would Allah reveal to you the unseen. But [instead], Allah chooses of His messengers whom He wills, so believe in Allah and His messengers. And if you believe and fear Him, then for you is a great reward.', 'অসৎকে সৎ থেকে পৃথক না করা পর্যন্ত তোমরা যে অবস্থায় আছ, আল্লাহ মু’মিনদেরকে সে অবস্থায় ছেড়ে দিতে পারেন না এবং আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে গায়িবের বিধান জ্ঞাত করেন না, তবে আল্লাহ তাঁর রাসূলগণের মধ্যে যাকে ইচ্ছে বেছে নেন, কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহ এবং তাঁর রসূলগণের প্রতি ঈমান আন। যদি তোমরা ঈমান আন আর তাকওয়া অবলম্বন কর, তাহলে তোমাদের জন্য আছে মহাপুরস্কার।', 'Allah would not leave the believers in that [state] you are in [presently] until He separates the evil from the good. Nor would Allah reveal to you the unseen. But [instead], Allah chooses of His messengers whom He wills, so believe in Allah and His messengers. And if you believe and fear Him, then for you is a great reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003179.mp3', now()),
