"لَّهُم ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83843,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":83844,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":83845,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَرٌّۭ","transliteration":"sharrun","translation_bn":"অকল্যাণ","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83846,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83848,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"سَيُطَوَّقُونَ","transliteration":"sayuṭawwaqūna","translation_bn":"তাদের (গলায়) বেড়ি পরানো হবে","root":"طوق","lemma":"يُطَوَّقُ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":83849,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83850,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَخِلُوا۟","transliteration":"bakhilū","translation_bn":"তারা কৃপণতা করেছে","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83851,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83852,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":83853,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"কিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83855,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহরই জন্য","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83856,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِيرَٰثُ","transliteration":"mīrāthu","translation_bn":"সত্ত্বাধিকার","root":"ورث","lemma":"مِيرَٰث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83857,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83858,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83860,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83861,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"সে সম্পর্কে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83862,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করছ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83863,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"khabīrun","translation_bn":"খুবই অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83864,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"١٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yaḥsabanna alladhīna yabkhalūna bimā ātāhumu l-lahu min faḍlihi huwa khayran lahum bal huwa sharrun lahum sayuṭawwaqūna mā bakhilū bihi yawma l-qiyāmati walillahi mīrāthu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wal-lahu bimā taʿmalūna khabīrun', 'আল্লাহ নিজ অনুগ্রহে যা তাদেরকে দিয়েছেন তাতে যারা কৃপণতা করে, তারা যেন মনে না করে যে, তা তাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর, বরং তা তাদের জন্য (খুবই) অকল্যাণকর, তারা যাতে কৃপণতা করেছে, সত্বর ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন তারই বেড়ি তাদের গলায় পরিয়ে দেয়া হবে। আসমান ও যমীনের স্বত্বাধিকার কেবল আল্লাহরই। তোমরা যা কিছুই করছ আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পূর্ণরূপে অবহিত।', 'And let not those who [greedily] withhold what Allah has given them of His bounty ever think that it is better for them. Rather, it is worse for them. Their necks will be encircled by what they withheld on the Day of Resurrection. And to Allah belongs the heritage of the heavens and the earth. And Allah, with what you do, is [fully] Acquainted.', 'আল্লাহ নিজ অনুগ্রহে যা তাদেরকে দিয়েছেন তাতে যারা কৃপণতা করে, তারা যেন মনে না করে যে, তা তাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর, বরং তা তাদের জন্য (খুবই) অকল্যাণকর, তারা যাতে কৃপণতা করেছে, সত্বর ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন তারই বেড়ি তাদের গলায় পরিয়ে দেয়া হবে। আসমান ও যমীনের স্বত্বাধিকার কেবল আল্লাহরই। তোমরা যা কিছুই করছ আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পূর্ণরূপে অবহিত।', 'And let not those who [greedily] withhold what Allah has given them of His bounty ever think that it is better for them. Rather, it is worse for them. Their necks will be encircled by what they withheld on the Day of Resurrection. And to Allah belongs the heritage of the heavens and the earth. And Allah, with what you do, is [fully] Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003180.mp3', now()),
  (3, 181, '', '[{"id":83865,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":83866,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَمِعَ","transliteration":"samiʿa","translation_bn":"শুনেছেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83867,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83868,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلَ","transliteration":"qawla","translation_bn":"(তাদের) কথা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83869,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83870,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83871,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"''''নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83872,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83873,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَقِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"faqīrun","translation_bn":"দরিদ্র","root":"فقر","lemma":"فَقِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83874,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَنَحْنُ","transliteration":"wanaḥnu","translation_bn":"আর আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"وَنَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83875,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَغْنِيَآءُ ۘ","transliteration":"aghniyāu","translation_bn":"ধনী''''","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83877,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَنَكْتُبُ","transliteration":"sanaktubu","translation_bn":"আমরা লিখে রাখবো","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":83878,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83879,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83880,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَقَتْلَهُمُ","transliteration":"waqatlahumu","translation_bn":"ও তাদের হত্যা করা","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83881,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ","transliteration":"l-anbiyāa","translation_bn":"নবীদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83882,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ব্যাতিত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83883,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"حَقٍّۢ","transliteration":"ḥaqqin","translation_bn":"ন্যায়ভাবে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83884,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَنَقُولُ","transliteration":"wanaqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা বলব","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83885,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhūqū","translation_bn":"''''তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83886,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83887,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرِيقِ","transliteration":"l-ḥarīqi","translation_bn":"দহনের''''","root":"حرق","lemma":"حَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83888,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad samiʿa l-lahu qawla alladhīna qālū inna l-laha faqīrun wanaḥnu aghniyāu sanaktubu mā qālū waqatlahumu l-anbiyāa bighayri ḥaqqin wanaqūlu dhūqū ʿadhāba l-ḥarīqi', 'আল্লাহ অবশ্যই তাদের উক্তি শ্রবণ করেছেন যারা বলে, ‘আল্লাহ দরিদ্র এবং আমরা ধনী’, তারা যা বলে তা আমি অবশ্যই লিপিবদ্ধ করে রাখব এবং (তাদের) অন্যায়ভাবে নাবীগণকে হত্যা করার বিষয়টিও (লিপিবদ্ধ করে রাখব) এবং আমি বলব- ‘জাহান্নামের দহন যন্ত্রণা ভোগ কর’।', 'Allah has certainly heard the statement of those [Jews] who said, "Indeed, Allah is poor, while we are rich." We will record what they said and their killing of the prophets without right and will say, "Taste the punishment of the Burning Fire.', 'আল্লাহ অবশ্যই তাদের উক্তি শ্রবণ করেছেন যারা বলে, ‘আল্লাহ দরিদ্র এবং আমরা ধনী’, তারা যা বলে তা আমি অবশ্যই লিপিবদ্ধ করে রাখব এবং (তাদের) অন্যায়ভাবে নাবীগণকে হত্যা করার বিষয়টিও (লিপিবদ্ধ করে রাখব) এবং আমি বলব- ‘জাহান্নামের দহন যন্ত্রণা ভোগ কর’।', 'Allah has certainly heard the statement of those [Jews] who said, "Indeed, Allah is poor, while we are rich." We will record what they said and their killing of the prophets without right and will say, "Taste the punishment of the Burning Fire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003181.mp3', now()),
  (3, 182, '', '[{"id":83961,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":83962,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"একারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83963,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدَّمَتْ","transliteration":"qaddamat","translation_bn":"আগে পাঠিয়েছে","root":"قدم","lemma":"قَدَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83964,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيكُمْ","transliteration":"aydīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের হাত (অর্থাৎ) কৃতকর্ম","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83965,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83966,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83967,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নন","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83968,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِظَلَّامٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓallāmin","translation_bn":"জুলুমকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَّٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83969,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْعَبِيدِ","transliteration":"lil''ʿabīdi","translation_bn":"বান্দাদের উপর","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83970,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika bimā qaddamat aydīkum wa-anna l-laha laysa biẓallāmin lil''ʿabīdi', 'এটা তোমাদের আগেই পাঠানো কাজের বিনিময়, কারণ আল্লাহ স্বীয় বান্দাগণের প্রতি কোন প্রকার যুলম করেন না।', 'That is for what your hands have put forth and because Allah is not ever unjust to [His] servants."', 'এটা তোমাদের আগেই পাঠানো কাজের বিনিময়, কারণ আল্লাহ স্বীয় বান্দাগণের প্রতি কোন প্রকার যুলম করেন না।', 'That is for what your hands have put forth and because Allah is not ever unjust to [His] servants."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003182.mp3', now()),
  (3, 183, '', '[{"id":83986,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83987,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83988,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"''''নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83989,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83990,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَهِدَ","transliteration":"ʿahida","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ দিয়েছেন","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83991,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَآ","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"আমাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83992,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":83993,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نُؤْمِنَ","transliteration":"nu''mina","translation_bn":"আমরা ঈমান আনব","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83994,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِرَسُولٍ","transliteration":"lirasūlin","translation_bn":"কোন রাসূলের উপর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83995,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83996,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيَنَا","transliteration":"yatiyanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে নিয়ে আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83997,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِقُرْبَانٍۢ","transliteration":"biqur''bānin","translation_bn":"এক কুরবানী","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرْبَان","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83998,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُهُ","transliteration":"takuluhu","translation_bn":"তা খেয়ে ফেলবে","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83999,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"(অদৃশ্যের) আগুন''''","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84001,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84002,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"''''নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":84003,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84004,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلٌۭ","transliteration":"rusulun","translation_bn":"অনেক রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84005,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84006,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِى","transliteration":"qablī","translation_bn":"আমার পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84007,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"উজ্জ্বল নিদর্শন সহকারে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84008,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَبِٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"wabi-alladhī","translation_bn":"এবং ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84009,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"قُلْتُمْ","transliteration":"qul''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলেছ","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84010,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَلِمَ","transliteration":"falima","translation_bn":"তবে কেন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84011,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلْتُمُوهُمْ","transliteration":"qataltumūhum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হত্যা করেছ তাদেরকে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84012,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":84013,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84014,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84015,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna qālū inna l-laha ʿahida ilaynā allā nu''mina lirasūlin ḥattā yatiyanā biqur''bānin takuluhu l-nāru qul qad jāakum rusulun min qablī bil-bayināti wabi-alladhī qul''tum falima qataltumūhum in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'যারা ব’লে থাকে যে, ‘আল্লাহ আমাদের কাছে অঙ্গীকার নিয়েছেন, যেন আমরা আগুনে গ্রাস করে এমন কোন কুরবানী আমাদের সামনে না দেখানো পর্যন্ত কোন রসূলের প্রতি ঈমান না আনি’। বল, ‘আমার পূর্বে বহু রসূল বহু প্রমাণসহ তোমাদের নিকট এসেছিল এবং তোমাদের কথিত সেই মু’জিযা নিয়েও (এসেছিল)। যদি তোমরা সত্যবাদী হও, তাহলে কেন তোমরা তাদেরকে হত্যা করেছিলে?’', '[They are] those who said, "Indeed, Allah has taken our promise not to believe any messenger until he brings us an offering which fire [from heaven] will consume." Say, "There have already come to you messengers before me with clear proofs and [even] that of which you speak. So why did you kill them, if you should be truthful?"', 'যারা ব’লে থাকে যে, ‘আল্লাহ আমাদের কাছে অঙ্গীকার নিয়েছেন, যেন আমরা আগুনে গ্রাস করে এমন কোন কুরবানী আমাদের সামনে না দেখানো পর্যন্ত কোন রসূলের প্রতি ঈমান না আনি’। বল, ‘আমার পূর্বে বহু রসূল বহু প্রমাণসহ তোমাদের নিকট এসেছিল এবং তোমাদের কথিত সেই মু’জিযা নিয়েও (এসেছিল)। যদি তোমরা সত্যবাদী হও, তাহলে কেন তোমরা তাদেরকে হত্যা করেছিলে?’', '[They are] those who said, "Indeed, Allah has taken our promise not to believe any messenger until he brings us an offering which fire [from heaven] will consume." Say, "There have already come to you messengers before me with clear proofs and [even] that of which you speak. So why did you kill them, if you should be truthful?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003183.mp3', now()),
  (3, 184, '', '[{"id":84053,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"যদি তবুও","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84054,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوكَ","transliteration":"kadhabūka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে অস্বীকার করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84055,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"তবে (নতুন কিছু নয়)","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":84056,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُذِّبَ","transliteration":"kudhiba","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84057,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلٌۭ","transliteration":"rusulun","translation_bn":"রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84058,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84059,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্বেও","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84060,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَآءُو","transliteration":"jāū","translation_bn":"তারা এসেছিল","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84061,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট নিদর্শনসহ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84062,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلزُّبُرِ","transliteration":"wal-zuburi","translation_bn":"ও (অনেক) সহীফা","root":"زبر","lemma":"زُبُر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84063,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"wal-kitābi","translation_bn":"ও কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84064,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُنِيرِ","transliteration":"l-munīri","translation_bn":"আলোকদানকারী (সাথে নিয়ে)","root":"نور","lemma":"مُّنِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84065,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in kadhabūka faqad kudhiba rusulun min qablika jāū bil-bayināti wal-zuburi wal-kitābi l-munīri', 'তারপরও যদি কাফিরগণ তোমাকে অস্বীকার করে, তবে তোমার পূর্বেও রসূলগণকে অস্বীকার করা হয়েছিল যারা স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন, অনেক সহীফা এবং দীপ্তিমান কিতাব নিয়ে এসেছিল।', 'Then if they deny you, [O Muhammad] - so were messengers denied before you, who brought clear proofs and written ordinances and the enlightening Scripture.', 'তারপরও যদি কাফিরগণ তোমাকে অস্বীকার করে, তবে তোমার পূর্বেও রসূলগণকে অস্বীকার করা হয়েছিল যারা স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন, অনেক সহীফা এবং দীপ্তিমান কিতাব নিয়ে এসেছিল।', 'Then if they deny you, [O Muhammad] - so were messengers denied before you, who brought clear proofs and written ordinances and the enlightening Scripture.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/003184.mp3', now()),
  (3, 185, '', '[{"id":84104,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84105,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তিই","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84106,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذَآئِقَةُ","transliteration":"dhāiqatu","translation_bn":"স্বাদ গ্রহণকারী (হবে)","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَا^ئِقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84107,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-mawti","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুর","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84109,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّمَا","transliteration":"wa-innamā","translation_bn":"এবং প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84110,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُوَفَّوْنَ","transliteration":"tuwaffawna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পূর্ণ দেয়া হবে","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84111,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُجُورَكُمْ","transliteration":"ujūrakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পুরস্কার সমূহ","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84112,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":84113,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"কিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84115,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84116,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"زُحْزِحَ","transliteration":"zuḥ''ziḥa","translation_bn":"রক্ষা করা হবে","root":"زحزح","lemma":"زُحْزِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84117,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","l